7	100	34	1	1	{"en_US": "Tip: How to keep late receipts under control?", "es_AR": "Consejo: ¿Cómo controlar los recibos atrasados?"}	{"en_US": "<div>\\n    <p class=\\"tip_title\\">Tip: How to keep late receipts under control?</p>\\n    <p class=\\"tip_content\\">When creating a purchase order, have a look at the vendor's <i>On Time Delivery</i> rate: the percentage of products shipped on time. If it is too low, activate the <i>automated reminders</i>. A few days before the due shipment, Odoo will send the vendor an email to ask confirmation of shipment dates and keep you informed in case of any delays. To get the vendor's performance statistics, click on the OTD rate.</p>\\n    <img src=\\"https://download.odoocdn.com/digests/purchase/static/src/img/milk-OTDPurchase.gif\\" width=\\"540\\" class=\\"illustration_border\\">\\n</div>\\n            ", "es_AR": "<div>\\n    <p class=\\"tip_title\\">Consejo: ¿Cómo controlar los recibos atrasados?</p>\\n    <p class=\\"tip_content\\">Observe la tasa de <i>entrega a tiempo</i> del proveedor al crear una orden de compra, ese es el porcentaje de productos que el proveedor ha entregado a tiempo y si es demasiado bajo, active los <i>recordatorios automáticos</i>. Odoo enviará al proveedor un correo electrónico unos días antes del vencimiento del envío para solicitar la confirmación de las fechas de envío y que sepa si llega a existir alguna demora. Haga clic en la tasa de entrega a tiempo para obtener las estadísticas de rendimiento del proveedor.</p>\\n    <img src=\\"https://download.odoocdn.com/digests/purchase/static/src/img/milk-OTDPurchase.gif\\" width=\\"540\\" class=\\"illustration_border\\">\\n</div>\\n            "}	2026-10-30 14:04:17.038965	2026-11-03 19:19:23.649434
16	400	64	1	1	{"en_US": "Tip: Add shapes to energize your Website", "es_AR": "Consejo: agregue formas para energizar su sitio web"}	{"en_US": "<div>\\n    <p class=\\"tip_title\\">Tip: Add shapes to energize your Website</p>\\n    <p class=\\"tip_content\\">More than 90 shapes exist and their colors are picked to match your Theme.</p>\\n    <img src=\\"https://download.odoocdn.com/digests/website/static/src/img/milk-website-shapes.gif\\" width=\\"540\\" class=\\"illustration_border\\">\\n</div>\\n            ", "es_AR": "<div>\\n    <p class=\\"tip_title\\">Consejo: agregue formas para energizar su sitio web</p>\\n    <p class=\\"tip_content\\">Existen más de 90 figuras y sus colores se seleccionan para combinar con su tema.</p>\\n    <img src=\\"https://download.odoocdn.com/digests/website/static/src/img/milk-website-shapes.gif\\" width=\\"540\\" class=\\"illustration_border\\">\\n</div>\\n            "}	2026-10-30 15:04:32.762047	2026-10-30 15:04:32.762047
