702	16	\N	1	1	account_default_terms_and_conditions	\N	account.account_default_terms_and_conditions	qweb	account/views/terms_template.xml	primary	{"en_US": "<t t-name=\\"account.account_default_terms_and_conditions\\">\\n        <div>\\n            <h1>STANDARD TERMS AND CONDITIONS OF SALE</h1>\\n            <p>You should update this document to reflect your T&amp;C.</p>\\n            <p>Below text serves as a suggestion and doesn’t engage Odoo S.A. responsibility.</p>\\n            <ol>\\n                <li>\\n                    The client explicitly waives its own standard terms and conditions, even if these were drawn up after these standard terms and conditions of sale. In order to be valid, any derogation must be expressly agreed to in advance in writing.\\n                </li>\\n                <li>\\n                    Our invoices are payable within 21 working days, unless another payment timeframe is indicated on either the invoice or the order. In the event of non-payment by the due date, <t t-out=\\"company_name\\"/> reserves the right to request a fixed interest payment amounting to 10% of the sum remaining due. <t t-out=\\"company_name\\"/> will be authorized to suspend any provision of services without prior warning in the event of late payment.\\n                </li>\\n                <li>\\n                    If a payment is still outstanding more than sixty (60) days after the due payment date, <t t-out=\\"company_name\\"/> reserves the right to call on the services of a debt recovery company. All legal expenses will be payable by the client.\\n                </li>\\n                <li>\\n                    Certain countries apply withholding at source on the amount of invoices, in accordance with their internal legislation. Any withholding at source will be paid by the client to the tax authorities. Under no circumstances can <t t-out=\\"company_name\\"/> become involved in costs related to a country's legislation. The amount of the invoice will therefore be due to <t t-out=\\"company_name\\"/> in its entirety and does not include any costs relating to the legislation of the country in which the client is located.\\n                </li>\\n                <li>\\n                    <t t-out=\\"company_name\\"/> undertakes to do its best to supply performant services in due time in accordance with the agreed timeframes. However, none of its obligations can be considered as being an obligation to achieve results. <t t-out=\\"company_name\\"/> cannot under any circumstances, be required by the client to appear as a third party in the context of any claim for damages filed against the client by an end consumer.\\n                </li>\\n                <li>\\n                    In order for it to be admissible, <t t-out=\\"company_name\\"/> must be notified of any claim by means of a letter sent by recorded delivery to its registered office within 8 days of the delivery of the goods or the provision of the services.\\n                </li>\\n                <li>\\n                    All our contractual relations will be governed exclusively by <t t-out=\\"company_country\\"/> law.\\n                </li>\\n            </ol>\\n        </div>\\n    </t>", "es_AR": "<t t-name=\\"account.account_default_terms_and_conditions\\">\\n        <div>\\n            <h1>TÉRMINOS Y CONDICIONES ESTÁNDAR DE VENTA</h1>\\n            <p>Debe actualizar este documento para que refleje sus términos y condiciones.</p>\\n            <p>El siguiente texto sirve como sugerencia y deslinda a Odoo S.A. de cualquier responsabilidad.</p>\\n            <ol>\\n                <li>\\n                    El cliente renuncia explícitamente a sus propios términos y condiciones estándar, incluso si se redactaron después de estos términos y condiciones estándar de venta. Para que sea válida, cualquier derogación debe acordarse expresamente por escrito y con antelación.\\n                </li>\\n                <li>\\n                    Nuestras facturas se pueden pagar en un plazo de 21 días laborales, a menos que otro plazo de pago se indique en la factura o en la orden. En caso de impago en la fecha de vencimiento,   <t t-out=\\"company_name\\"/> se reserva el derecho de solicitar un pago de intereses fijo que asciende al 10% de la suma que queda por pagar. <t t-out=\\"company_name\\"/> estará autorizada a suspender cualquier prestación de servicios sin previo aviso en caso de retraso en el pago.\\n                </li>\\n                <li>\\n                    Si un pago sigue pendiente por más de sesenta (60) días después de la fecha límite, <t t-out=\\"company_name\\"/> se reserva el derecho de recurrir a los servicios de una empresa de cobro de deudas. Todos los gastos legales correrán a cargo del cliente.\\n                </li>\\n                <li>\\n                    Algunos países aplican retenciones en origen sobre el importe de las facturas, de acuerdo con su legislación interna. El cliente deberá pagar cualquier retención en el origen a las autoridades fiscales. En ningún caso <t t-out=\\"company_name\\"/> se involucran en los costos relacionados con la legislación de un país. Por lo tanto, el importe de la factura se deberá a <t t-out=\\"company_name\\"/> en su totalidad y no incluye ningún costo relacionado con la legislación del país en el que se encuentra el cliente.\\n                </li>\\n                <li>\\n                    <t t-out=\\"company_name\\"/> se compromete a hacer todo lo posible para prestar los servicios en el plazo acordado. Sin embargo, ninguna de sus obligaciones puede considerarse como una obligación a obtener resultados. <t t-out=\\"company_name\\"/> no puede, por ningún motivo, ser requerido por el cliente para comparecer como una parte tercera en caso de que un consumidor final presente un reclamo contra el cliente por daños.\\n                </li>\\n                <li>\\n                    Para que sea admisible,  <t t-out=\\"company_name\\"/> debe recibir notificación de cualquier reclamo mediante una carta que se enviará por correo certificado a su oficina registrada en un plazo de 8 días desde la entrega de los bienes o la prestación de los servicios.\\n                </li>\\n                <li>\\n                    Nuestras relaciones contractuales se regirán por <t t-out=\\"company_country\\"/> ley.\\n                </li>\\n            </ol>\\n        </div>\\n    </t>"}	<?xml version="1.0"?>\n<t t-name="account.account_default_terms_and_conditions">\n        <div>\n            <h1>STANDARD TERMS AND CONDITIONS OF SALE</h1>\n            <p>You should update this document to reflect your T&amp;C.</p>\n            <p>Below text serves as a suggestion and doesn’t engage Odoo S.A. responsibility.</p>\n            <ol>\n                <li>\n                    The client explicitly waives its own standard terms and conditions, even if these were drawn up after these standard terms and conditions of sale. In order to be valid, any derogation must be expressly agreed to in advance in writing.\n                </li>\n                <li>\n                    Our invoices are payable within 21 working days, unless another payment timeframe is indicated on either the invoice or the order. In the event of non-payment by the due date, <t t-out="company_name"/> reserves the right to request a fixed interest payment amounting to 10% of the sum remaining due. <t t-out="company_name"/> will be authorized to suspend any provision of services without prior warning in the event of late payment.\n                </li>\n                <li>\n                    If a payment is still outstanding more than sixty (60) days after the due payment date, <t t-out="company_name"/> reserves the right to call on the services of a debt recovery company. All legal expenses will be payable by the client.\n                </li>\n                <li>\n                    Certain countries apply withholding at source on the amount of invoices, in accordance with their internal legislation. Any withholding at source will be paid by the client to the tax authorities. Under no circumstances can <t t-out="company_name"/> become involved in costs related to a country's legislation. The amount of the invoice will therefore be due to <t t-out="company_name"/> in its entirety and does not include any costs relating to the legislation of the country in which the client is located.\n                </li>\n                <li>\n                    <t t-out="company_name"/> undertakes to do its best to supply performant services in due time in accordance with the agreed timeframes. However, none of its obligations can be considered as being an obligation to achieve results. <t t-out="company_name"/> cannot under any circumstances, be required by the client to appear as a third party in the context of any claim for damages filed against the client by an end consumer.\n                </li>\n                <li>\n                    In order for it to be admissible, <t t-out="company_name"/> must be notified of any claim by means of a letter sent by recorded delivery to its registered office within 8 days of the delivery of the goods or the provision of the services.\n                </li>\n                <li>\n                    All our contractual relations will be governed exclusively by <t t-out="company_country"/> law.\n                </li>\n            </ol>\n        </div>\n    </t>\n\n	f	t	2026-10-23 14:02:50.18711	2026-10-23 14:02:50.18711	f	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N
1088	16	\N	1	1	Sales Order Portal Content	\N	sale.sale_order_portal_content	qweb	sale/views/sale_portal_templates.xml	primary	{"en_US": "<t name=\\"Sales Order Portal Content\\" t-name=\\"sale.sale_order_portal_content\\">\\n        <!-- Intro -->\\n        <div id=\\"introduction\\" t-attf-class=\\"#{'border-bottom-0 pt-0 pb-3 bg-white' if report_type == 'html' else ''}\\">\\n            <div class=\\"row\\" id=\\"intro_row\\">\\n                <h2 class=\\"my-0 col-12 col-lg flex-grow-1 mb-1 mb-lg-0\\">\\n                    <t t-out=\\"sale_order.type_name\\"/> -\\n                    <em t-out=\\"sale_order.name\\"/>\\n                </h2>\\n            </div>\\n        </div>\\n        <div id=\\"content\\">\\n            <div id=\\"informations\\" class=\\"row\\">\\n                <span id=\\"transaction_info\\">\\n                    <div t-if=\\"sale_order.get_portal_last_transaction() and not invoices and sale_order.state in ('sent', 'sale') and portal_confirmation == 'pay' and not success and not error\\" t-att-data-order-id=\\"sale_order.id\\">\\n                        <t t-if=\\"sale_order.transaction_ids\\">\\n                            <t t-call=\\"payment.transaction_status\\">\\n                            <t t-set=\\"tx\\" t-value=\\"sale_order.get_portal_last_transaction()\\"/>\\n                        </t>\\n                    </t>\\n                    </div>\\n                </span>\\n                <!-- Information -->\\n                <div id=\\"sale_info\\" class=\\"col-12 col-lg-6 mb-4\\">\\n                    <span id=\\"sale_info_title\\">\\n                        <h4 class=\\"mb-1\\">Sale Information</h4>\\n                        <hr class=\\"mt-1 mb-2\\"/>\\n                    </span>\\n                    <table class=\\"table table-borderless table-sm\\">\\n                        <tbody style=\\"white-space:nowrap\\" id=\\"sale_info_table\\">\\n                            <tr>\\n                                <th t-if=\\"sale_order.state in ['sale', 'cancel']\\" class=\\"ps-0 pb-0\\">Order Date:</th>\\n                                <th t-else=\\"\\" class=\\"ps-0 pb-0\\">Date:</th>\\n                                <td class=\\"w-100 pb-0 text-wrap\\"><span t-field=\\"sale_order.date_order\\" t-options=\\"{&quot;widget&quot;: &quot;date&quot;}\\"/></td>\\n                            </tr>\\n                            <tr t-if=\\"sale_order.validity_date and sale_order.state in ['draft', 'sent']\\">\\n                                <th class=\\"ps-0 pb-0\\">Expiration Date:</th>\\n                                <td class=\\"w-100 pb-0 text-wrap\\"><span t-field=\\"sale_order.validity_date\\" t-options=\\"{&quot;widget&quot;: &quot;date&quot;}\\"/></td>\\n                            </tr>\\n                            <tr t-if=\\"sale_order.client_order_ref\\">\\n                                <th class=\\"ps-0 pb-0\\">Your Reference:</th>\\n                                <td class=\\"w-100 pb-0 text-wrap\\"><span t-field=\\"sale_order.client_order_ref\\"/></td>\\n                            </tr>\\n                        </tbody>\\n                    </table>\\n                </div>\\n\\n                <!-- ======  Customer Information  ====== -->\\n                <div id=\\"customer_info\\" class=\\"col-12 col-lg-6 mb-4\\">\\n                    <h4 class=\\"mb-1\\">\\n                        <t t-if=\\"sale_order.partner_shipping_id == sale_order.partner_invoice_id\\">\\n                            Invoicing and Shipping Address\\n                        </t>\\n                        <t t-else=\\"\\">\\n                            Invoicing Address\\n                        </t>\\n                        <small t-if=\\"sale_order.partner_id == sale_order.partner_invoice_id == sale_order.env.user.partner_id\\">\\n                            <a class=\\"small\\" t-attf-href=\\"/my/account?redirect={{sale_order.get_portal_url()}}\\">\\n                                <i class=\\"fa fa-fw fa-pencil\\"/>\\n                            </a>\\n                        </small>\\n                    </h4>\\n                    <hr class=\\"mt-1 mb-2\\"/>\\n                    <div t-field=\\"sale_order.partner_invoice_id\\" t-options=\\"{'widget': 'contact', 'fields': ['name', 'address', 'phone', 'email']}\\"/>\\n                    <span t-if=\\"sale_order.partner_shipping_id != sale_order.partner_invoice_id\\" id=\\"shipping_address\\" class=\\"col-lg-6\\">\\n                        <br/>\\n                        <h4 class=\\"mb-1\\">\\n                            Shipping Address\\n                        </h4>\\n                        <hr class=\\"mt-1 mb-2\\"/>\\n                        <div t-field=\\"sale_order.partner_shipping_id\\" t-options=\\"{ &quot;widget&quot;: &quot;contact&quot;, &quot;fields&quot;: [ &quot;name&quot;, &quot;address&quot;]}\\"/>\\n                    </span>\\n                </div>\\n                <t t-set=\\"invoices\\" t-value=\\"sale_order.invoice_ids.filtered(lambda i: i.state not in ['draft', 'cancel']).sorted('date', reverse=True)[:3]\\"/>\\n                <div id=\\"sale_invoices\\" t-if=\\"invoices and sale_order.state in ['sale', 'cancel']\\" class=\\"col-12 col-lg-6 mb-4\\">\\n                    <h4 class=\\"mb-1\\">Last Invoices</h4>\\n                    <hr class=\\"mt-1 mb-2\\"/>\\n                    <t t-foreach=\\"invoices\\" t-as=\\"i\\">\\n                        <t t-set=\\"report_url\\" t-value=\\"i.get_portal_url()\\"/>\\n                        <t t-set=\\"authorized_tx_ids\\" t-value=\\"i.authorized_transaction_ids\\"/>\\n                        <div class=\\"d-flex flex-column\\">\\n                            <div class=\\"d-flex align-items-center justify-content-between\\">\\n                                <a t-att-href=\\"report_url\\">\\n                                    <span t-out=\\"i.name\\"/>\\n                                </a>\\n                                <div t-if=\\"i.payment_state in ('paid', 'in_payment')\\" class=\\"small badge text-bg-success orders_label_text_align\\">\\n                                    <i class=\\"fa fa-fw fa-check\\"/> Paid\\n                                </div>\\n                                <div t-elif=\\"i.payment_state == 'reversed'\\" class=\\"small badge text-bg-success orders_label_text_align\\">\\n                                    <i class=\\"fa fa-fw fa-check\\"/> Reversed\\n                                </div>\\n                                <div t-elif=\\"authorized_tx_ids\\" class=\\"small badge text-bg-success orders_label_text_align\\">\\n                                    <i class=\\"fa fa-fw fa-check\\"/> Authorized\\n                                </div>\\n                                <div t-else=\\"\\" class=\\"small badge text-bg-info orders_label_text_align\\">\\n                                    <i class=\\"fa fa-fw fa-clock-o\\"/> Waiting Payment\\n                                </div>\\n                            </div>\\n                            <div class=\\"small d-lg-inline-block\\">Date: <span class=\\"text-muted\\" t-field=\\"i.invoice_date\\"/></div>\\n                        </div>\\n                    </t>\\n                </div>\\n            </div>\\n\\n            <section id=\\"details\\" style=\\"page-break-inside: auto;\\">\\n                <t t-if=\\"product_documents\\">\\n                    <h4 id=\\"details\\">Documents</h4>\\n                    <div class=\\"d-flex flex-grow-1 flex-wrap gap-1 mb32\\">\\n                        <t t-foreach=\\"product_documents\\" t-as=\\"document_sudo\\">\\n                            <div class=\\"bg-light p-2 rounded\\">\\n                                <div class=\\"position-relative text-center\\">\\n                                    <t t-set=\\"attachment_sudo\\" t-value=\\"document_sudo.ir_attachment_id\\"/>\\n                                    <t t-set=\\"target\\" t-value=\\"attachment_sudo.type == 'url' and '_blank' or '_self'\\"/>\\n                                    <a t-att-href=\\"sale_order.get_portal_url('/document/' + str(document_sudo.id))\\" t-att-target=\\"target\\" class=\\"d-flex flex-row\\">\\n                                        <div class=\\"o_image\\" t-att-title=\\"attachment_sudo.name\\" t-att-data-mimetype=\\"attachment_sudo.mimetype\\" t-attf-data-src=\\"/web/image/#{attachment_sudo.id}/100x80?access_token=#{attachment_sudo.access_token}\\"/>\\n                                        <div class=\\"o_portal_product_document align-self-center\\" t-out=\\"attachment_sudo.name\\"/>\\n                                    </a>\\n                                </div>\\n                            </div>\\n                        </t>\\n                    </div>\\n                </t>\\n\\n                <t t-set=\\"display_discount\\" t-value=\\"True in [line.discount &gt; 0 for line in sale_order.order_line]\\"/>\\n\\n                <div class=\\"table-responsive\\">\\n                    <table t-att-data-order-id=\\"sale_order.id\\" t-att-data-token=\\"sale_order.access_token\\" class=\\"table table-sm\\" id=\\"sales_order_table\\">\\n                        <thead class=\\"bg-100\\">\\n                            <tr>\\n                                <th class=\\"text-start\\" id=\\"product_name_header\\">Products</th>\\n                                <th class=\\"text-end\\" id=\\"product_qty_header\\">Quantity</th>\\n                                <th t-attf-class=\\"text-end {{ 'd-none d-sm-table-cell' if report_type == 'html' else '' }}\\">\\n                                    Unit Price\\n                                </th>\\n                                <th t-if=\\"display_discount\\" t-attf-class=\\"text-end {{ 'd-none d-sm-table-cell' if report_type == 'html' else '' }}\\">\\n                                    <span>Disc.%</span>\\n                                </th>\\n                                <th t-attf-class=\\"text-end {{ 'd-none d-md-table-cell' if report_type == 'html' else '' }}\\" id=\\"taxes_header\\">\\n                                    <span>Taxes</span>\\n                                </th>\\n                                <th class=\\"text-end\\" id=\\"subtotal_header\\">\\n                                    <span>Amount</span>\\n                                </th>\\n                            </tr>\\n                        </thead>\\n                        <tbody class=\\"sale_tbody\\">\\n\\n                            <t t-set=\\"current_subtotal\\" t-value=\\"0\\"/>\\n                            <t t-set=\\"lines_to_report\\" t-value=\\"sale_order._get_order_lines_to_report()\\"/>\\n\\n                            <t t-foreach=\\"lines_to_report\\" t-as=\\"line\\">\\n\\n                                <t t-set=\\"current_subtotal\\" t-value=\\"current_subtotal + line.price_subtotal\\"/>\\n\\n                                <tr t-att-class=\\"'bg-200 fw-bold o_line_section' if line.display_type == 'line_section' else 'fst-italic o_line_note' if line.display_type == 'line_note' else ''\\">\\n                                    <t t-if=\\"not line.display_type\\">\\n                                        <td id=\\"product_name\\">\\n                                            <span t-field=\\"line.name\\"/>\\n                                        </td>\\n                                        <td class=\\"text-end\\" id=\\"quote_qty_td\\">\\n                                            <div id=\\"quote_qty\\">\\n                                                <span t-field=\\"line.product_uom_qty\\"/>\\n                                                <span t-field=\\"line.product_uom\\"/>\\n                                            </div>\\n                                        </td>\\n                                        <td t-attf-class=\\"text-end {{ 'd-none d-sm-table-cell' if report_type == 'html' else '' }}\\">\\n                                            <div t-if=\\"line.discount &gt;= 0\\" t-field=\\"line.price_unit\\" t-att-style=\\"line.discount and 'text-decoration: line-through' or None\\" t-att-class=\\"(line.discount and 'text-danger' or '') + ' text-end'\\"/>\\n                                            <div t-if=\\"line.discount\\">\\n                                                <t t-out=\\"(1-line.discount / 100.0) * line.price_unit\\" t-options=\\"{&quot;widget&quot;: &quot;float&quot;, &quot;decimal_precision&quot;: &quot;Product Price&quot;}\\"/>\\n                                            </div>\\n                                        </td>\\n                                        <td t-if=\\"display_discount\\" t-attf-class=\\"text-end {{ 'd-none d-sm-table-cell' if report_type == 'html' else '' }}\\">\\n                                            <strong t-if=\\"line.discount &gt; 0\\" class=\\"text-info\\">\\n                                                <t t-out=\\"((line.discount % 1) and '%s' or '%d') % line.discount\\"/>%\\n                                            </strong>\\n                                        </td>\\n                                        <td t-attf-class=\\"text-end {{ 'd-none d-md-table-cell' if report_type == 'html' else '' }}\\" id=\\"taxes\\">\\n                                            <span t-out=\\"', '.join(map(lambda x: (x.description or x.name), line.tax_id))\\"/>\\n                                        </td>\\n                                        <td t-if=\\"not line.is_downpayment\\" class=\\"text-end\\" id=\\"subtotal\\">\\n                                        <span class=\\"oe_order_line_price_subtotal\\" t-field=\\"line.price_subtotal\\"/>\\n                                        </td>\\n                                    </t>\\n                                    <t t-if=\\"line.display_type == 'line_section'\\">\\n                                        <td colspan=\\"99\\">\\n                                            <span t-field=\\"line.name\\"/>\\n                                        </td>\\n                                        <t t-set=\\"current_section\\" t-value=\\"line\\"/>\\n                                        <t t-set=\\"current_subtotal\\" t-value=\\"0\\"/>\\n                                    </t>\\n                                    <t t-if=\\"line.display_type == 'line_note'\\">\\n                                        <td colspan=\\"99\\">\\n                                            <span t-field=\\"line.name\\"/>\\n                                        </td>\\n                                    </t>\\n                                </tr>\\n                                <tr t-if=\\"current_section and (line_last or lines_to_report[line_index+1].display_type == 'line_section') and not line.is_downpayment\\" class=\\"is-subtotal text-end\\">\\n                                    <td colspan=\\"99\\">\\n                                        <strong class=\\"mr16\\">Subtotal</strong>\\n                                        <span t-out=\\"current_subtotal\\" t-options=\\"{&quot;widget&quot;: &quot;monetary&quot;, &quot;display_currency&quot;: sale_order.currency_id}\\"/>\\n                                    </td>\\n                                </tr>\\n                            </t>\\n                        </tbody>\\n                    </table>\\n                </div>\\n\\n                <div id=\\"total\\" name=\\"total\\" style=\\"page-break-inside: avoid;\\">\\n                    <div class=\\"col-xs-7 col-md-5 ms-auto\\">\\n                        <t t-call=\\"sale.sale_order_portal_content_totals_table\\"/>\\n                    </div>\\n                </div>\\n            </section>\\n\\n            <section t-if=\\"sale_order.signature\\" id=\\"signature\\" name=\\"Signature\\">\\n                <div class=\\"row mt-4\\" name=\\"signature\\">\\n                    <div t-attf-class=\\"#{'col-3' if report_type != 'html' else 'col-sm-7 col-md-4'} ms-auto text-center\\">\\n                        <h5>Signature</h5>\\n                        <img t-att-src=\\"image_data_uri(sale_order.signature)\\" style=\\"max-height: 6rem; max-width: 100%;\\"/>\\n                        <p t-field=\\"sale_order.signed_by\\"/>\\n                    </div>\\n                </div>\\n            </section>\\n\\n            <section t-if=\\"not is_html_empty(sale_order.note)\\" id=\\"terms\\" class=\\"mt-4\\">\\n                <h4 class=\\"\\">Terms &amp; Conditions</h4>\\n                <hr class=\\"mt-0 mb-1\\"/>\\n                <t t-if=\\"sale_order.terms_type == 'html'\\">\\n                    <!-- Note is plain text. This ensures a clickable link  -->\\n                    <t t-set=\\"tc_url\\" t-value=\\"'%s/terms' % (sale_order.get_base_url())\\"/>\\n                    <em>Terms &amp; Conditions: <a href=\\"/terms\\"><t t-out=\\"tc_url\\"/></a></em>\\n                </t>\\n                <t t-else=\\"\\">\\n                    <em t-field=\\"sale_order.note\\"/>\\n                </t>\\n            </section>\\n\\n            <section t-if=\\"sale_order.payment_term_id\\" class=\\"mt-4\\">\\n                <h4 class=\\"\\">Payment terms</h4>\\n                <hr class=\\"mt-0 mb-1\\"/>\\n                <span t-field=\\"sale_order.payment_term_id.note\\"/>\\n            </section>\\n        </div>\\n    </t>", "es_AR": "<t name=\\"Sales Order Portal Content\\" t-name=\\"sale.sale_order_portal_content\\">\\n        <!-- Intro -->\\n        <div id=\\"introduction\\" t-attf-class=\\"#{'border-bottom-0 pt-0 pb-3 bg-white' if report_type == 'html' else ''}\\">\\n            <div class=\\"row\\" id=\\"intro_row\\">\\n                <h2 class=\\"my-0 col-12 col-lg flex-grow-1 mb-1 mb-lg-0\\">\\n                    <t t-out=\\"sale_order.type_name\\"/> -\\n                    <em t-out=\\"sale_order.name\\"/>\\n                </h2>\\n            </div>\\n        </div>\\n        <div id=\\"content\\">\\n            <div id=\\"informations\\" class=\\"row\\">\\n                <span id=\\"transaction_info\\">\\n                    <div t-if=\\"sale_order.get_portal_last_transaction() and not invoices and sale_order.state in ('sent', 'sale') and portal_confirmation == 'pay' and not success and not error\\" t-att-data-order-id=\\"sale_order.id\\">\\n                        <t t-if=\\"sale_order.transaction_ids\\">\\n                            <t t-call=\\"payment.transaction_status\\">\\n                            <t t-set=\\"tx\\" t-value=\\"sale_order.get_portal_last_transaction()\\"/>\\n                        </t>\\n                    </t>\\n                    </div>\\n                </span>\\n                <!-- Information -->\\n                <div id=\\"sale_info\\" class=\\"col-12 col-lg-6 mb-4\\">\\n                    <span id=\\"sale_info_title\\">\\n                        <h4 class=\\"mb-1\\">Información de la venta</h4>\\n                        <hr class=\\"mt-1 mb-2\\"/>\\n                    </span>\\n                    <table class=\\"table table-borderless table-sm\\">\\n                        <tbody style=\\"white-space:nowrap\\" id=\\"sale_info_table\\">\\n                            <tr>\\n                                <th t-if=\\"sale_order.state in ['sale', 'cancel']\\" class=\\"ps-0 pb-0\\">Fecha de la orden:</th>\\n                                <th t-else=\\"\\" class=\\"ps-0 pb-0\\">Fecha:</th>\\n                                <td class=\\"w-100 pb-0 text-wrap\\"><span t-field=\\"sale_order.date_order\\" t-options=\\"{&quot;widget&quot;: &quot;date&quot;}\\"/></td>\\n                            </tr>\\n                            <tr t-if=\\"sale_order.validity_date and sale_order.state in ['draft', 'sent']\\">\\n                                <th class=\\"ps-0 pb-0\\">Fecha de vencimiento:</th>\\n                                <td class=\\"w-100 pb-0 text-wrap\\"><span t-field=\\"sale_order.validity_date\\" t-options=\\"{&quot;widget&quot;: &quot;date&quot;}\\"/></td>\\n                            </tr>\\n                            <tr t-if=\\"sale_order.client_order_ref\\">\\n                                <th class=\\"ps-0 pb-0\\">Su referencia:</th>\\n                                <td class=\\"w-100 pb-0 text-wrap\\"><span t-field=\\"sale_order.client_order_ref\\"/></td>\\n                            </tr>\\n                        </tbody>\\n                    </table>\\n                </div>\\n\\n                <!-- ======  Customer Information  ====== -->\\n                <div id=\\"customer_info\\" class=\\"col-12 col-lg-6 mb-4\\">\\n                    <h4 class=\\"mb-1\\">\\n                        <t t-if=\\"sale_order.partner_shipping_id == sale_order.partner_invoice_id\\">\\n                            Dirección de facturación y envío\\n                        </t>\\n                        <t t-else=\\"\\">\\n                            Dirección de facturación\\n                        </t>\\n                        <small t-if=\\"sale_order.partner_id == sale_order.partner_invoice_id == sale_order.env.user.partner_id\\">\\n                            <a class=\\"small\\" t-attf-href=\\"/my/account?redirect={{sale_order.get_portal_url()}}\\">\\n                                <i class=\\"fa fa-fw fa-pencil\\"/>\\n                            </a>\\n                        </small>\\n                    </h4>\\n                    <hr class=\\"mt-1 mb-2\\"/>\\n                    <div t-field=\\"sale_order.partner_invoice_id\\" t-options=\\"{'widget': 'contact', 'fields': ['name', 'address', 'phone', 'email']}\\"/>\\n                    <span t-if=\\"sale_order.partner_shipping_id != sale_order.partner_invoice_id\\" id=\\"shipping_address\\" class=\\"col-lg-6\\">\\n                        <br/>\\n                        <h4 class=\\"mb-1\\">\\n                            Dirección de envío\\n                        </h4>\\n                        <hr class=\\"mt-1 mb-2\\"/>\\n                        <div t-field=\\"sale_order.partner_shipping_id\\" t-options=\\"{ &quot;widget&quot;: &quot;contact&quot;, &quot;fields&quot;: [ &quot;name&quot;, &quot;address&quot;]}\\"/>\\n                    </span>\\n                </div>\\n                <t t-set=\\"invoices\\" t-value=\\"sale_order.invoice_ids.filtered(lambda i: i.state not in ['draft', 'cancel']).sorted('date', reverse=True)[:3]\\"/>\\n                <div id=\\"sale_invoices\\" t-if=\\"invoices and sale_order.state in ['sale', 'cancel']\\" class=\\"col-12 col-lg-6 mb-4\\">\\n                    <h4 class=\\"mb-1\\">Facturas más recientes</h4>\\n                    <hr class=\\"mt-1 mb-2\\"/>\\n                    <t t-foreach=\\"invoices\\" t-as=\\"i\\">\\n                        <t t-set=\\"report_url\\" t-value=\\"i.get_portal_url()\\"/>\\n                        <t t-set=\\"authorized_tx_ids\\" t-value=\\"i.authorized_transaction_ids\\"/>\\n                        <div class=\\"d-flex flex-column\\">\\n                            <div class=\\"d-flex align-items-center justify-content-between\\">\\n                                <a t-att-href=\\"report_url\\">\\n                                    <span t-out=\\"i.name\\"/>\\n                                </a>\\n                                <div t-if=\\"i.payment_state in ('paid', 'in_payment')\\" class=\\"small badge text-bg-success orders_label_text_align\\">\\n                                    <i class=\\"fa fa-fw fa-check\\"/>Pagado\\n                                </div>\\n                                <div t-elif=\\"i.payment_state == 'reversed'\\" class=\\"small badge text-bg-success orders_label_text_align\\">\\n                                    <i class=\\"fa fa-fw fa-check\\"/> Revertida\\n                                </div>\\n                                <div t-elif=\\"authorized_tx_ids\\" class=\\"small badge text-bg-success orders_label_text_align\\">\\n                                    <i class=\\"fa fa-fw fa-check\\"/> Autorizado\\n                                </div>\\n                                <div t-else=\\"\\" class=\\"small badge text-bg-info orders_label_text_align\\">\\n                                    <i class=\\"fa fa-fw fa-clock-o\\"/> En espera de pago\\n                                </div>\\n                            </div>\\n                            <div class=\\"small d-lg-inline-block\\">Fecha: <span class=\\"text-muted\\" t-field=\\"i.invoice_date\\"/></div>\\n                        </div>\\n                    </t>\\n                </div>\\n            </div>\\n\\n            <section id=\\"details\\" style=\\"page-break-inside: auto;\\">\\n                <t t-if=\\"product_documents\\">\\n                    <h4 id=\\"details\\">Documentos</h4>\\n                    <div class=\\"d-flex flex-grow-1 flex-wrap gap-1 mb32\\">\\n                        <t t-foreach=\\"product_documents\\" t-as=\\"document_sudo\\">\\n                            <div class=\\"bg-light p-2 rounded\\">\\n                                <div class=\\"position-relative text-center\\">\\n                                    <t t-set=\\"attachment_sudo\\" t-value=\\"document_sudo.ir_attachment_id\\"/>\\n                                    <t t-set=\\"target\\" t-value=\\"attachment_sudo.type == 'url' and '_blank' or '_self'\\"/>\\n                                    <a t-att-href=\\"sale_order.get_portal_url('/document/' + str(document_sudo.id))\\" t-att-target=\\"target\\" class=\\"d-flex flex-row\\">\\n                                        <div class=\\"o_image\\" t-att-title=\\"attachment_sudo.name\\" t-att-data-mimetype=\\"attachment_sudo.mimetype\\" t-attf-data-src=\\"/web/image/#{attachment_sudo.id}/100x80?access_token=#{attachment_sudo.access_token}\\"/>\\n                                        <div class=\\"o_portal_product_document align-self-center\\" t-out=\\"attachment_sudo.name\\"/>\\n                                    </a>\\n                                </div>\\n                            </div>\\n                        </t>\\n                    </div>\\n                </t>\\n\\n                <t t-set=\\"display_discount\\" t-value=\\"True in [line.discount &gt; 0 for line in sale_order.order_line]\\"/>\\n\\n                <div class=\\"table-responsive\\">\\n                    <table t-att-data-order-id=\\"sale_order.id\\" t-att-data-token=\\"sale_order.access_token\\" class=\\"table table-sm\\" id=\\"sales_order_table\\">\\n                        <thead class=\\"bg-100\\">\\n                            <tr>\\n                                <th class=\\"text-start\\" id=\\"product_name_header\\">Productos</th>\\n                                <th class=\\"text-end\\" id=\\"product_qty_header\\">Cantidad</th>\\n                                <th t-attf-class=\\"text-end {{ 'd-none d-sm-table-cell' if report_type == 'html' else '' }}\\">\\n                                    Precio unitario\\n                                </th>\\n                                <th t-if=\\"display_discount\\" t-attf-class=\\"text-end {{ 'd-none d-sm-table-cell' if report_type == 'html' else '' }}\\">\\n                                    <span>% de desc.</span>\\n                                </th>\\n                                <th t-attf-class=\\"text-end {{ 'd-none d-md-table-cell' if report_type == 'html' else '' }}\\" id=\\"taxes_header\\">\\n                                    <span>Impuestos</span>\\n                                </th>\\n                                <th class=\\"text-end\\" id=\\"subtotal_header\\">\\n                                    <span>Importe</span>\\n                                </th>\\n                            </tr>\\n                        </thead>\\n                        <tbody class=\\"sale_tbody\\">\\n\\n                            <t t-set=\\"current_subtotal\\" t-value=\\"0\\"/>\\n                            <t t-set=\\"lines_to_report\\" t-value=\\"sale_order._get_order_lines_to_report()\\"/>\\n\\n                            <t t-foreach=\\"lines_to_report\\" t-as=\\"line\\">\\n\\n                                <t t-set=\\"current_subtotal\\" t-value=\\"current_subtotal + line.price_subtotal\\"/>\\n\\n                                <tr t-att-class=\\"'bg-200 fw-bold o_line_section' if line.display_type == 'line_section' else 'fst-italic o_line_note' if line.display_type == 'line_note' else ''\\">\\n                                    <t t-if=\\"not line.display_type\\">\\n                                        <td id=\\"product_name\\">\\n                                            <span t-field=\\"line.name\\"/>\\n                                        </td>\\n                                        <td class=\\"text-end\\" id=\\"quote_qty_td\\">\\n                                            <div id=\\"quote_qty\\">\\n                                                <span t-field=\\"line.product_uom_qty\\"/>\\n                                                <span t-field=\\"line.product_uom\\"/>\\n                                            </div>\\n                                        </td>\\n                                        <td t-attf-class=\\"text-end {{ 'd-none d-sm-table-cell' if report_type == 'html' else '' }}\\">\\n                                            <div t-if=\\"line.discount &gt;= 0\\" t-field=\\"line.price_unit\\" t-att-style=\\"line.discount and 'text-decoration: line-through' or None\\" t-att-class=\\"(line.discount and 'text-danger' or '') + ' text-end'\\"/>\\n                                            <div t-if=\\"line.discount\\">\\n                                                <t t-out=\\"(1-line.discount / 100.0) * line.price_unit\\" t-options=\\"{&quot;widget&quot;: &quot;float&quot;, &quot;decimal_precision&quot;: &quot;Product Price&quot;}\\"/>\\n                                            </div>\\n                                        </td>\\n                                        <td t-if=\\"display_discount\\" t-attf-class=\\"text-end {{ 'd-none d-sm-table-cell' if report_type == 'html' else '' }}\\">\\n                                            <strong t-if=\\"line.discount &gt; 0\\" class=\\"text-info\\">\\n                                                <t t-out=\\"((line.discount % 1) and '%s' or '%d') % line.discount\\"/>%\\n                                            </strong>\\n                                        </td>\\n                                        <td t-attf-class=\\"text-end {{ 'd-none d-md-table-cell' if report_type == 'html' else '' }}\\" id=\\"taxes\\">\\n                                            <span t-out=\\"', '.join(map(lambda x: (x.description or x.name), line.tax_id))\\"/>\\n                                        </td>\\n                                        <td t-if=\\"not line.is_downpayment\\" class=\\"text-end\\" id=\\"subtotal\\">\\n                                        <span class=\\"oe_order_line_price_subtotal\\" t-field=\\"line.price_subtotal\\"/>\\n                                        </td>\\n                                    </t>\\n                                    <t t-if=\\"line.display_type == 'line_section'\\">\\n                                        <td colspan=\\"99\\">\\n                                            <span t-field=\\"line.name\\"/>\\n                                        </td>\\n                                        <t t-set=\\"current_section\\" t-value=\\"line\\"/>\\n                                        <t t-set=\\"current_subtotal\\" t-value=\\"0\\"/>\\n                                    </t>\\n                                    <t t-if=\\"line.display_type == 'line_note'\\">\\n                                        <td colspan=\\"99\\">\\n                                            <span t-field=\\"line.name\\"/>\\n                                        </td>\\n                                    </t>\\n                                </tr>\\n                                <tr t-if=\\"current_section and (line_last or lines_to_report[line_index+1].display_type == 'line_section') and not line.is_downpayment\\" class=\\"is-subtotal text-end\\">\\n                                    <td colspan=\\"99\\">\\n                                        <strong class=\\"mr16\\">Subtotal</strong>\\n                                        <span t-out=\\"current_subtotal\\" t-options=\\"{&quot;widget&quot;: &quot;monetary&quot;, &quot;display_currency&quot;: sale_order.currency_id}\\"/>\\n                                    </td>\\n                                </tr>\\n                            </t>\\n                        </tbody>\\n                    </table>\\n                </div>\\n\\n                <div id=\\"total\\" name=\\"total\\" style=\\"page-break-inside: avoid;\\">\\n                    <div class=\\"col-xs-7 col-md-5 ms-auto\\">\\n                        <t t-call=\\"sale.sale_order_portal_content_totals_table\\"/>\\n                    </div>\\n                </div>\\n            </section>\\n\\n            <section t-if=\\"sale_order.signature\\" id=\\"signature\\" name=\\"Signature\\">\\n                <div class=\\"row mt-4\\" name=\\"signature\\">\\n                    <div t-attf-class=\\"#{'col-3' if report_type != 'html' else 'col-sm-7 col-md-4'} ms-auto text-center\\">\\n                        <h5>Firma</h5>\\n                        <img t-att-src=\\"image_data_uri(sale_order.signature)\\" style=\\"max-height: 6rem; max-width: 100%;\\"/>\\n                        <p t-field=\\"sale_order.signed_by\\"/>\\n                    </div>\\n                </div>\\n            </section>\\n\\n            <section t-if=\\"not is_html_empty(sale_order.note)\\" id=\\"terms\\" class=\\"mt-4\\">\\n                <h4 class=\\"\\">Términos y condiciones</h4>\\n                <hr class=\\"mt-0 mb-1\\"/>\\n                <t t-if=\\"sale_order.terms_type == 'html'\\">\\n                    <!-- Note is plain text. This ensures a clickable link  -->\\n                    <t t-set=\\"tc_url\\" t-value=\\"'%s/terms' % (sale_order.get_base_url())\\"/>\\n                    <em>Términos y condiciones <a href=\\"/terms\\"><t t-out=\\"tc_url\\"/></a></em>\\n                </t>\\n                <t t-else=\\"\\">\\n                    <em t-field=\\"sale_order.note\\"/>\\n                </t>\\n            </section>\\n\\n            <section t-if=\\"sale_order.payment_term_id\\" class=\\"mt-4\\">\\n                <h4 class=\\"\\">Términos de pago</h4>\\n                <hr class=\\"mt-0 mb-1\\"/>\\n                <span t-field=\\"sale_order.payment_term_id.note\\"/>\\n            </section>\\n        </div>\\n    </t>"}	<?xml version="1.0"?>\n<t name="Sales Order Portal Content" t-name="sale.sale_order_portal_content">\n        <!-- Intro -->\n        <div id="introduction" t-attf-class="#{'border-bottom-0 pt-0 pb-3 bg-white' if report_type == 'html' else ''}">\n            <div class="row" id="intro_row">\n                <h2 class="my-0 col-12 col-lg flex-grow-1 mb-1 mb-lg-0">\n                    <t t-out="sale_order.type_name"/> -\n                    <em t-out="sale_order.name"/>\n                </h2>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n        <div id="content">\n            <div id="informations" class="row">\n                <span id="transaction_info">\n                    <div t-if="sale_order.get_portal_last_transaction() and not invoices and sale_order.state in ('sent', 'sale') and portal_confirmation == 'pay' and not success and not error" t-att-data-order-id="sale_order.id">\n                        <t t-if="sale_order.transaction_ids">\n                            <t t-call="payment.transaction_status">\n                            <t t-set="tx" t-value="sale_order.get_portal_last_transaction()"/>\n                        </t>\n                    </t>\n                    </div>\n                </span>\n                <!-- Information -->\n                <div id="sale_info" class="col-12 col-lg-6 mb-4">\n                    <span id="sale_info_title">\n                        <h4 class="mb-1">Sale Information</h4>\n                        <hr class="mt-1 mb-2"/>\n                    </span>\n                    <table class="table table-borderless table-sm">\n                        <tbody style="white-space:nowrap" id="sale_info_table">\n                            <tr>\n                                <th t-if="sale_order.state in ['sale', 'cancel']" class="ps-0 pb-0">Order Date:</th>\n                                <th t-else="" class="ps-0 pb-0">Date:</th>\n                                <td class="w-100 pb-0 text-wrap"><span t-field="sale_order.date_order" t-options="{&quot;widget&quot;: &quot;date&quot;}"/></td>\n                            </tr>\n                            <tr t-if="sale_order.validity_date and sale_order.state in ['draft', 'sent']">\n                                <th class="ps-0 pb-0">Expiration Date:</th>\n                                <td class="w-100 pb-0 text-wrap"><span t-field="sale_order.validity_date" t-options="{&quot;widget&quot;: &quot;date&quot;}"/></td>\n                            </tr>\n                            <tr t-if="sale_order.client_order_ref">\n                                <th class="ps-0 pb-0">Your Reference:</th>\n                                <td class="w-100 pb-0 text-wrap"><span t-field="sale_order.client_order_ref"/></td>\n                            </tr>\n                        </tbody>\n                    </table>\n                </div>\n\n                <!-- ======  Customer Information  ====== -->\n                <div id="customer_info" class="col-12 col-lg-6 mb-4">\n                    <h4 class="mb-1">\n                        <t t-if="sale_order.partner_shipping_id == sale_order.partner_invoice_id">\n                            Invoicing and Shipping Address\n                        </t>\n                        <t t-else="">\n                            Invoicing Address\n                        </t>\n                        <small t-if="sale_order.partner_id == sale_order.partner_invoice_id == sale_order.env.user.partner_id">\n                            <a class="small" t-attf-href="/my/account?redirect={{sale_order.get_portal_url()}}">\n                                <i class="fa fa-fw fa-pencil"/>\n                            </a>\n                        </small>\n                    </h4>\n                    <hr class="mt-1 mb-2"/>\n                    <div t-field="sale_order.partner_invoice_id" t-options="{'widget': 'contact', 'fields': ['name', 'address', 'phone', 'email']}"/>\n                    <span t-if="sale_order.partner_shipping_id != sale_order.partner_invoice_id" id="shipping_address" class="col-lg-6">\n                        <br/>\n                        <h4 class="mb-1">\n                            Shipping Address\n                        </h4>\n                        <hr class="mt-1 mb-2"/>\n                        <div t-field="sale_order.partner_shipping_id" t-options="{ &quot;widget&quot;: &quot;contact&quot;, &quot;fields&quot;: [ &quot;name&quot;, &quot;address&quot;]}"/>\n                    </span>\n                </div>\n                <t t-set="invoices" t-value="sale_order.invoice_ids.filtered(lambda i: i.state not in ['draft', 'cancel']).sorted('date', reverse=True)[:3]"/>\n                <div id="sale_invoices" t-if="invoices and sale_order.state in ['sale', 'cancel']" class="col-12 col-lg-6 mb-4">\n                    <h4 class="mb-1">Last Invoices</h4>\n                    <hr class="mt-1 mb-2"/>\n                    <t t-foreach="invoices" t-as="i">\n                        <t t-set="report_url" t-value="i.get_portal_url()"/>\n                        <t t-set="authorized_tx_ids" t-value="i.authorized_transaction_ids"/>\n                        <div class="d-flex flex-column">\n                            <div class="d-flex align-items-center justify-content-between">\n                                <a t-att-href="report_url">\n                                    <span t-out="i.name"/>\n                                </a>\n                                <div t-if="i.payment_state in ('paid', 'in_payment')" class="small badge text-bg-success orders_label_text_align">\n                                    <i class="fa fa-fw fa-check"/> Paid\n                                </div>\n                                <div t-elif="i.payment_state == 'reversed'" class="small badge text-bg-success orders_label_text_align">\n                                    <i class="fa fa-fw fa-check"/> Reversed\n                                </div>\n                                <div t-elif="authorized_tx_ids" class="small badge text-bg-success orders_label_text_align">\n                                    <i class="fa fa-fw fa-check"/> Authorized\n                                </div>\n                                <div t-else="" class="small badge text-bg-info orders_label_text_align">\n                                    <i class="fa fa-fw fa-clock-o"/> Waiting Payment\n                                </div>\n                            </div>\n                            <div class="small d-lg-inline-block">Date: <span class="text-muted" t-field="i.invoice_date"/></div>\n                        </div>\n                    </t>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <section id="details" style="page-break-inside: auto;">\n                <t t-if="product_documents">\n                    <h4 id="details">Documents</h4>\n                    <div class="d-flex flex-grow-1 flex-wrap gap-1 mb32">\n                        <t t-foreach="product_documents" t-as="document_sudo">\n                            <div class="bg-light p-2 rounded">\n                                <div class="position-relative text-center">\n                                    <t t-set="attachment_sudo" t-value="document_sudo.ir_attachment_id"/>\n                                    <t t-set="target" t-value="attachment_sudo.type == 'url' and '_blank' or '_self'"/>\n                                    <a t-att-href="sale_order.get_portal_url('/document/' + str(document_sudo.id))" t-att-target="target" class="d-flex flex-row">\n                                        <div class="o_image" t-att-title="attachment_sudo.name" t-att-data-mimetype="attachment_sudo.mimetype" t-attf-data-src="/web/image/#{attachment_sudo.id}/100x80?access_token=#{attachment_sudo.access_token}"/>\n                                        <div class="o_portal_product_document align-self-center" t-out="attachment_sudo.name"/>\n                                    </a>\n                                </div>\n                            </div>\n                        </t>\n                    </div>\n                </t>\n\n                <t t-set="display_discount" t-value="True in [line.discount &gt; 0 for line in sale_order.order_line]"/>\n\n                <div class="table-responsive">\n                    <table t-att-data-order-id="sale_order.id" t-att-data-token="sale_order.access_token" class="table table-sm" id="sales_order_table">\n                        <thead class="bg-100">\n                            <tr>\n                                <th class="text-start" id="product_name_header">Products</th>\n                                <th class="text-end" id="product_qty_header">Quantity</th>\n                                <th t-attf-class="text-end {{ 'd-none d-sm-table-cell' if report_type == 'html' else '' }}">\n                                    Unit Price\n                                </th>\n                                <th t-if="display_discount" t-attf-class="text-end {{ 'd-none d-sm-table-cell' if report_type == 'html' else '' }}">\n                                    <span>Disc.%</span>\n                                </th>\n                                <th t-attf-class="text-end {{ 'd-none d-md-table-cell' if report_type == 'html' else '' }}" id="taxes_header">\n                                    <span>Taxes</span>\n                                </th>\n                                <th class="text-end" id="subtotal_header">\n                                    <span>Amount</span>\n                                </th>\n                            </tr>\n                        </thead>\n                        <tbody class="sale_tbody">\n\n                            <t t-set="current_subtotal" t-value="0"/>\n                            <t t-set="lines_to_report" t-value="sale_order._get_order_lines_to_report()"/>\n\n                            <t t-foreach="lines_to_report" t-as="line">\n\n                                <t t-set="current_subtotal" t-value="current_subtotal + line.price_subtotal"/>\n\n                                <tr t-att-class="'bg-200 fw-bold o_line_section' if line.display_type == 'line_section' else 'fst-italic o_line_note' if line.display_type == 'line_note' else ''">\n                                    <t t-if="not line.display_type">\n                                        <td id="product_name">\n                                            <span t-field="line.name"/>\n                                        </td>\n                                        <td class="text-end" id="quote_qty_td">\n                                            <div id="quote_qty">\n                                                <span t-field="line.product_uom_qty"/>\n                                                <span t-field="line.product_uom"/>\n                                            </div>\n                                        </td>\n                                        <td t-attf-class="text-end {{ 'd-none d-sm-table-cell' if report_type == 'html' else '' }}">\n                                            <div t-if="line.discount &gt;= 0" t-field="line.price_unit" t-att-style="line.discount and 'text-decoration: line-through' or None" t-att-class="(line.discount and 'text-danger' or '') + ' text-end'"/>\n                                            <div t-if="line.discount">\n                                                <t t-out="(1-line.discount / 100.0) * line.price_unit" t-options="{&quot;widget&quot;: &quot;float&quot;, &quot;decimal_precision&quot;: &quot;Product Price&quot;}"/>\n                                            </div>\n                                        </td>\n                                        <td t-if="display_discount" t-attf-class="text-end {{ 'd-none d-sm-table-cell' if report_type == 'html' else '' }}">\n                                            <strong t-if="line.discount &gt; 0" class="text-info">\n                                                <t t-out="((line.discount % 1) and '%s' or '%d') % line.discount"/>%\n                                            </strong>\n                                        </td>\n                                        <td t-attf-class="text-end {{ 'd-none d-md-table-cell' if report_type == 'html' else '' }}" id="taxes">\n                                            <span t-out="', '.join(map(lambda x: (x.description or x.name), line.tax_id))"/>\n                                        </td>\n                                        <td t-if="not line.is_downpayment" class="text-end" id="subtotal">\n                                        <span class="oe_order_line_price_subtotal" t-field="line.price_subtotal"/>\n                                        </td>\n                                    </t>\n                                    <t t-if="line.display_type == 'line_section'">\n                                        <td colspan="99">\n                                            <span t-field="line.name"/>\n                                        </td>\n                                        <t t-set="current_section" t-value="line"/>\n                                        <t t-set="current_subtotal" t-value="0"/>\n                                    </t>\n                                    <t t-if="line.display_type == 'line_note'">\n                                        <td colspan="99">\n                                            <span t-field="line.name"/>\n                                        </td>\n                                    </t>\n                                </tr>\n                                <tr t-if="current_section and (line_last or lines_to_report[line_index+1].display_type == 'line_section') and not line.is_downpayment" class="is-subtotal text-end">\n                                    <td colspan="99">\n                                        <strong class="mr16">Subtotal</strong>\n                                        <span t-out="current_subtotal" t-options="{&quot;widget&quot;: &quot;monetary&quot;, &quot;display_currency&quot;: sale_order.currency_id}"/>\n                                    </td>\n                                </tr>\n                            </t>\n                        </tbody>\n                    </table>\n                </div>\n\n                <div id="total" name="total" style="page-break-inside: avoid;">\n                    <div class="col-xs-7 col-md-5 ms-auto">\n                        <t t-call="sale.sale_order_portal_content_totals_table"/>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </section>\n\n            <section t-if="sale_order.signature" id="signature" name="Signature">\n                <div class="row mt-4" name="signature">\n                    <div t-attf-class="#{'col-3' if report_type != 'html' else 'col-sm-7 col-md-4'} ms-auto text-center">\n                        <h5>Signature</h5>\n                        <img t-att-src="image_data_uri(sale_order.signature)" style="max-height: 6rem; max-width: 100%;"/>\n                        <p t-field="sale_order.signed_by"/>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </section>\n\n            <section t-if="not is_html_empty(sale_order.note)" id="terms" class="mt-4">\n                <h4 class="">Terms &amp; Conditions</h4>\n                <hr class="mt-0 mb-1"/>\n                <t t-if="sale_order.terms_type == 'html'">\n                    <!-- Note is plain text. This ensures a clickable link  -->\n                    <t t-set="tc_url" t-value="'%s/terms' % (sale_order.get_base_url())"/>\n                    <em>Terms &amp; Conditions: <a href="/terms"><t t-out="tc_url"/></a></em>\n                </t>\n                <t t-else="">\n                    <em t-field="sale_order.note"/>\n                </t>\n            </section>\n\n            <section t-if="sale_order.payment_term_id" class="mt-4">\n                <h4 class="">Payment terms</h4>\n                <hr class="mt-0 mb-1"/>\n                <span t-field="sale_order.payment_term_id.note"/>\n            </section>\n        </div>\n    </t>\n\n    	f	t	2026-10-30 14:24:31.464076	2026-10-30 14:24:31.464076	f	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N
1087	16	534	1	1	Sales Order	\N	sale.sale_order_portal_template	qweb	sale/views/sale_portal_templates.xml	primary	{"en_US": "<data name=\\"Sales Order\\" inherit_id=\\"portal.portal_sidebar\\" primary=\\"True\\">\\n        <xpath expr=\\"//div[hasclass('o_portal_sidebar')]\\" position=\\"inside\\">\\n            <t t-set=\\"o_portal_fullwidth_alert\\" groups=\\"sales_team.group_sale_salesman\\">\\n                <!-- Uses backend_url provided in rendering values -->\\n                <t t-call=\\"portal.portal_back_in_edit_mode\\"/>\\n            </t>\\n\\n            <div class=\\"row o_portal_sale_sidebar\\">\\n                <!-- Sidebar -->\\n                <t t-call=\\"portal.portal_record_sidebar\\" id=\\"sale_order_portal_sidebar\\">\\n                    <t t-set=\\"classes\\" t-value=\\"'d-print-none col-lg-3 col-xl-4'\\"/>\\n\\n                    <t t-set=\\"title\\">\\n                        <h2 t-field=\\"sale_order.amount_total\\" data-id=\\"total_amount\\"/>\\n                    </t>\\n                    <t t-set=\\"entries\\">\\n                        <div class=\\"d-flex flex-column gap-4\\">\\n                            <div class=\\"d-flex flex-column gap-2\\" id=\\"sale_order_sidebar_button\\">\\n                                <a t-if=\\"sale_order._has_to_be_signed()\\" role=\\"button\\" class=\\"btn btn-primary d-block\\" data-bs-toggle=\\"modal\\" data-bs-target=\\"#modalaccept\\" href=\\"#\\">\\n                                    <i class=\\"fa fa-check\\"/><t t-if=\\"sale_order._has_to_be_paid()\\"> Sign &amp; Pay</t><t t-else=\\"\\"> Accept &amp; Sign</t>\\n                                </a>\\n                                <a t-elif=\\"sale_order._has_to_be_paid()\\" role=\\"button\\" id=\\"o_sale_portal_paynow\\" data-bs-toggle=\\"modal\\" data-bs-target=\\"#modalaccept\\" href=\\"#\\" t-att-class=\\"'d-block %s' % ('btn btn-light' if sale_order.transaction_ids else 'btn btn-primary')\\">\\n                                    <i class=\\"fa fa-check\\"/> <t t-if=\\"not sale_order.signature\\">Accept &amp; Pay</t><t t-else=\\"\\">Pay Now</t>\\n                                </a>\\n                                <div class=\\"o_download_pdf d-flex gap-1 flex-lg-column flex-xl-row\\">\\n                                    <div class=\\"flex-grow-1\\">\\n                                        <a class=\\"btn btn-secondary o_print_btn o_portal_invoice_print d-block\\" t-att-href=\\"sale_order.get_portal_url(report_type='pdf')\\" id=\\"print_invoice_report\\" title=\\"View Details\\" target=\\"_blank\\"><i class=\\"fa fa-print\\"/> View Details</a>\\n                                    </div>\\n                                </div>\\n                            </div>\\n\\n                            <div class=\\"navspy flex-grow-1 ps-0\\" t-ignore=\\"true\\" role=\\"complementary\\">\\n                                <ul class=\\"nav flex-column bs-sidenav\\"/>\\n                            </div>\\n\\n                            <t t-if=\\"not sale_order.is_expired and sale_order.state in ['draft', 'sent']\\">\\n                                <div t-if=\\"sale_order.amount_undiscounted - sale_order.amount_untaxed &gt; 0.01\\" class=\\"list-group-item flex-grow-1\\">\\n                                    <small><b class=\\"text-muted\\">Your advantage</b></small>\\n                                    <small>\\n                                        <b t-field=\\"sale_order.amount_undiscounted\\" t-options=\\"{&quot;widget&quot;: &quot;monetary&quot;, &quot;display_currency&quot;: sale_order.currency_id}\\" style=\\"text-decoration: line-through\\" class=\\"d-block mt-1\\" data-id=\\"amount_undiscounted\\"/>\\n                                    </small>\\n                                    <t t-if=\\"sale_order.amount_untaxed == sale_order.amount_total\\">\\n                                        <h4 t-field=\\"sale_order.amount_total\\" class=\\"text-success\\" data-id=\\"total_amount\\"/>\\n                                    </t>\\n                                    <t t-else=\\"\\">\\n                                        <h4 t-field=\\"sale_order.amount_untaxed\\" class=\\"text-success mb-0\\" data-id=\\"total_untaxed\\"/>\\n                                        <small>(<span t-field=\\"sale_order.amount_total\\" data-id=\\"total_amount\\"/> Incl. tax)</small>\\n                                    </t>\\n                                </div>\\n                            </t>\\n\\n                            <div t-if=\\"sale_order.user_id\\">\\n                                <h6><small class=\\"text-muted\\">Your contact</small></h6>\\n                                <div class=\\"o_portal_contact_details d-flex flex-column gap-2\\">\\n                                    <div class=\\"d-flex justify-content-start align-items-center gap-2\\">\\n                                        <img class=\\"o_avatar o_portal_contact_img rounded\\" t-att-src=\\"image_data_uri(sale_order.user_id.avatar_128)\\" alt=\\"Contact\\"/>\\n                                        <div>\\n                                            <h6 class=\\"mb-0\\" t-out=\\"sale_order.user_id.name\\"/>\\n                                            <a href=\\"#discussion\\" class=\\"d-flex align-items-center gap-2 small fw-bold\\">\\n                                            Send message\\n                                            </a>\\n                                        </div>\\n                                    </div>\\n                                </div>\\n                            </div>\\n                        </div>\\n                    </t>\\n                </t>\\n\\n                <!-- Page content -->\\n                <div id=\\"quote_content\\" class=\\"col-12 col-lg-9 col-xl-8 mt-5 mt-lg-0\\">\\n\\n                    <!-- modal relative to the actions sign and pay -->\\n                    <div role=\\"dialog\\" class=\\"modal fade\\" id=\\"modalaccept\\">\\n                        <div class=\\"modal-dialog\\" t-if=\\"sale_order._has_to_be_signed()\\">\\n                            <form id=\\"accept\\" method=\\"POST\\" t-att-data-order-id=\\"sale_order.id\\" t-att-data-token=\\"sale_order.access_token\\" class=\\"js_accept_json modal-content js_website_submit_form\\">\\n                                <input type=\\"hidden\\" name=\\"csrf_token\\" t-att-value=\\"request.csrf_token()\\"/>\\n                                <header class=\\"modal-header\\">\\n                                    <h4 class=\\"modal-title\\">Validate Order</h4>\\n                                    <button type=\\"button\\" class=\\"btn-close\\" data-bs-dismiss=\\"modal\\" aria-label=\\"Close\\"/>\\n                                </header>\\n                                <main class=\\"modal-body\\" id=\\"sign-dialog\\">\\n                                    <p>\\n                                        <span>By signing this proposal, I agree to the following terms:</span>\\n                                        <ul>\\n                                            <li>\\n                                                <span>Accepted on the behalf of:</span> <b t-field=\\"sale_order.partner_id.commercial_partner_id\\"/>\\n                                            </li>\\n                                            <li>\\n                                                <span>For an amount of:</span> <b data-id=\\"total_amount\\" t-field=\\"sale_order.amount_total\\"/>\\n                                            </li>\\n                                            <li t-if=\\"sale_order.payment_term_id\\">\\n                                                <span>With payment terms:</span> <b t-field=\\"sale_order.payment_term_id.note\\"/>\\n                                            </li>\\n                                        </ul>\\n                                    </p>\\n                                    <t t-call=\\"portal.signature_form\\">\\n                                        <t t-set=\\"call_url\\" t-value=\\"sale_order.get_portal_url(suffix='/accept')\\"/>\\n                                        <t t-set=\\"default_name\\" t-value=\\"sale_order.partner_id.name or sale_order.partner_id.commercial_partner_id.name\\"/>\\n                                    </t>\\n                                </main>\\n                            </form>\\n                        </div>\\n\\n                        <div class=\\"modal-dialog\\" t-if=\\"not sale_order._has_to_be_signed() and sale_order._has_to_be_paid()\\">\\n                            <div class=\\"modal-content\\">\\n                                <header class=\\"modal-header\\">\\n                                    <h4 class=\\"modal-title\\">Validate Order</h4>\\n                                    <button type=\\"button\\" class=\\"btn-close\\" data-bs-dismiss=\\"modal\\" aria-label=\\"Close\\"/>\\n                                </header>\\n                                <main class=\\"modal-body\\" id=\\"sign-dialog\\">\\n                                    <t t-set=\\"prepayment_amount\\" t-value=\\"sale_order._get_prepayment_required_amount()\\"/>\\n                                    <t t-set=\\"prepayment_available\\" t-value=\\"sale_order.prepayment_percent and sale_order.prepayment_percent != 1.0\\"/>\\n                                    <!-- Display choices only if a pre payment can confirm the order. -->\\n                                    <div t-if=\\"prepayment_available\\" id=\\"o_sale_portal_prepayment_buttons\\" class=\\"d-flex justify-content-center d-grid gap-2 btn-group\\">\\n                                        <button name=\\"o_sale_portal_amount_prepayment_button\\" class=\\"btn btn-primary rounded\\">\\n                                            Down payment <br/>\\n                                            <span t-esc=\\"prepayment_amount\\" class=\\"fw-bold\\" t-options=\\"{'widget': 'monetary', 'display_currency': sale_order.currency_id}\\"/>\\n                                        </button>\\n                                        <button name=\\"o_sale_portal_amount_total_button\\" class=\\"btn btn-primary rounded\\">\\n                                            Full amount <br/>\\n                                            <span t-field=\\"sale_order.amount_total\\"/>\\n                                        </button>\\n                                    </div>\\n                                    <p>\\n                                        <!-- The widget associated with this modal will hide and show divs in function of the amount selected. -->\\n                                        <div id=\\"o_sale_portal_use_amount_total\\">\\n                                            By paying this proposal, I agree to the following terms:\\n                                        </div>\\n                                        <div t-if=\\"prepayment_available\\" id=\\"o_sale_portal_use_amount_prepayment\\">\\n                                            By paying this <u>down payment</u> of\\n                                            <span t-esc=\\"prepayment_amount\\" class=\\"fw-bold\\" t-options=\\"{'widget': 'monetary', 'display_currency': sale_order.currency_id}\\"/>\\n                                            (<b t-esc=\\"sale_order.prepayment_percent * 100\\"/> %)\\n                                            for this proposal, I agree to the following terms:\\n                                        </div>\\n                                        <ul>\\n                                            <li>\\n                                                <span>Accepted on the behalf of:</span> <b t-field=\\"sale_order.partner_id.commercial_partner_id\\"/>\\n                                            </li>\\n                                            <li>\\n                                                <span>For an amount of:</span> <b data-id=\\"total_amount\\" t-field=\\"sale_order.amount_total\\"/>\\n                                            </li>\\n                                            <li t-if=\\"sale_order.payment_term_id\\">\\n                                                <span>With payment terms:</span> <b t-field=\\"sale_order.payment_term_id.note\\"/>\\n                                            </li>\\n                                        </ul>\\n                                    </p>\\n                                    <div t-if=\\"company_mismatch\\">\\n                                        <t t-call=\\"payment.company_mismatch_warning\\"/>\\n                                    </div>\\n                                    <div t-elif=\\"not sale_order._has_to_be_paid()\\" class=\\"alert alert-danger\\">\\n                                        The order is not in a state requiring customer payment.\\n                                    </div>\\n                                    <div t-elif=\\"not payment_methods_sudo and not tokens_sudo\\" class=\\"alert alert-warning\\">\\n                                        <strong>No suitable payment option could be found.</strong><br/>\\n                                        If you believe that it is an error, please contact the website administrator.\\n                                    </div>\\n                                    <div t-else=\\"\\" id=\\"payment_method\\" class=\\"text-start\\">\\n                                        <h3 class=\\"mb-3\\">Pay with</h3>\\n                                        <t t-call=\\"payment.form\\">\\n                                            <!-- Inject the order ID to allow Stripe to check if tokenization is required. -->\\n                                            <t t-set=\\"sale_order_id\\" t-value=\\"sale_order.id\\"/>\\n                                        </t>\\n                                    </div>\\n                                </main>\\n                            </div>\\n                        </div>\\n                    </div>\\n\\n                    <!-- modal relative to the action reject -->\\n                    <div role=\\"dialog\\" class=\\"modal fade\\" id=\\"modaldecline\\">\\n                        <div class=\\"modal-dialog\\">\\n                            <form id=\\"decline\\" method=\\"POST\\" t-attf-action=\\"/my/orders/#{sale_order.id}/decline?access_token=#{sale_order.access_token}\\" class=\\"modal-content\\">\\n                                <input type=\\"hidden\\" name=\\"csrf_token\\" t-att-value=\\"request.csrf_token()\\"/>\\n                                <header class=\\"modal-header\\">\\n                                    <h4 class=\\"modal-title\\">Reject This Quotation</h4>\\n                                    <button type=\\"button\\" class=\\"btn-close\\" data-bs-dismiss=\\"modal\\" aria-label=\\"Close\\"/>\\n                                </header>\\n                                <main class=\\"modal-body\\">\\n                                    <p>\\n                                        Tell us why you are refusing this quotation, this will help us improve our services.\\n                                    </p>\\n                                    <textarea rows=\\"4\\" name=\\"decline_message\\" required=\\"\\" placeholder=\\"Your feedback...\\" class=\\"form-control\\"/>\\n                                </main>\\n                                <footer class=\\"modal-footer\\">\\n                                    <button type=\\"submit\\" t-att-id=\\"sale_order.id\\" class=\\"btn btn-danger\\">\\n                                        <i class=\\"fa fa-times\\"/> Reject\\n                                    </button>\\n                                    <button type=\\"button\\" class=\\"btn btn-primary\\" data-bs-dismiss=\\"modal\\">\\n                                        Cancel\\n                                    </button>\\n                                </footer>\\n                            </form>\\n                        </div>\\n                    </div>\\n\\n                    <!-- status messages -->\\n                    <div t-if=\\"message == 'sign_ok'\\" class=\\"alert alert-success alert-dismissible d-print-none\\" role=\\"status\\">\\n                        <button type=\\"button\\" class=\\"btn-close\\" data-bs-dismiss=\\"alert\\" aria-label=\\"Close\\"/>\\n                        <strong>Thank You!</strong><br/>\\n                        <t t-if=\\"message == 'sign_ok' and sale_order.state == 'sale'\\">\\n                            Your order has been confirmed.\\n                        </t>\\n                        <t t-elif=\\"message == 'sign_ok' and sale_order._has_to_be_paid()\\">\\n                            Your order has been signed but still needs to be paid to be confirmed.\\n                        </t>\\n                        <t t-else=\\"\\">Your order has been signed.</t>\\n                    </div>\\n\\n                    <div t-if=\\"message == 'cant_reject'\\" class=\\"alert alert-danger alert-dismissible d-print-none\\" role=\\"alert\\">\\n                        <button type=\\"button\\" class=\\"btn-close\\" data-bs-dismiss=\\"alert\\" aria-label=\\"Close\\"/>\\n                        Your order is not in a state to be rejected.\\n                    </div>\\n\\n                    <t t-if=\\"sale_order.get_portal_last_transaction()\\">\\n                        <t t-call=\\"payment.transaction_status\\">\\n                            <t t-set=\\"tx\\" t-value=\\"sale_order.get_portal_last_transaction()\\"/>\\n                        </t>\\n                    </t>\\n\\n                    <div t-if=\\"sale_order.state == 'cancel'\\" class=\\"alert alert-danger alert-dismissible d-print-none\\" role=\\"alert\\">\\n                        <button type=\\"button\\" class=\\"btn-close\\" data-bs-dismiss=\\"alert\\" aria-label=\\"close\\"/>\\n                        <strong>This quotation has been canceled.</strong> <a role=\\"button\\" href=\\"#discussion\\"><i class=\\"fa fa-comment\\"/> Contact us to get a new quotation.</a>\\n                    </div>\\n\\n                    <div t-if=\\"sale_order.is_expired\\" class=\\"alert alert-warning alert-dismissible d-print-none\\" role=\\"alert\\">\\n                        <button type=\\"button\\" class=\\"btn-close\\" data-bs-dismiss=\\"alert\\" aria-label=\\"close\\"/>\\n                        <strong>This offer expired!</strong> <a role=\\"button\\" href=\\"#discussion\\"><i class=\\"fa fa-comment\\"/> Contact us to get a new quotation.</a>\\n                    </div>\\n\\n                    <!-- main content -->\\n                    <div t-attf-class=\\"#{'pb-5' if report_type == 'html' else ''}\\" id=\\"portal_sale_content\\">\\n                        <div t-call=\\"#{sale_order._get_name_portal_content_view()}\\"/>\\n                    </div>\\n\\n                    <!-- bottom actions -->\\n                    <div t-if=\\"sale_order._has_to_be_signed() or sale_order._has_to_be_paid()\\" class=\\"d-flex justify-content-center gap-1 d-print-none\\">\\n\\n                        <t t-if=\\"sale_order._has_to_be_signed()\\">\\n                            <div class=\\"col-sm-auto mt8\\">\\n                                <a role=\\"button\\" class=\\"btn btn-primary\\" data-bs-toggle=\\"modal\\" data-bs-target=\\"#modalaccept\\" href=\\"#\\"><i class=\\"fa fa-check\\"/><t t-if=\\"sale_order._has_to_be_paid()\\"> Sign &amp; Pay</t><t t-else=\\"\\"> Accept &amp; Sign</t></a>\\n                            </div>\\n                            <div class=\\"col-sm-auto mt8\\">\\n                                <a role=\\"button\\" class=\\"btn btn-secondary\\" href=\\"#discussion\\"><i class=\\"fa fa-comment\\"/> Feedback</a>\\n                            </div>\\n                            <div class=\\"col-sm-auto mt8\\">\\n                                <a role=\\"button\\" class=\\"btn btn-danger\\" data-bs-toggle=\\"modal\\" data-bs-target=\\"#modaldecline\\" href=\\"#\\"> <i class=\\"fa fa-times\\"/> Reject</a>\\n                            </div>\\n                        </t>\\n                        <div t-elif=\\"sale_order._has_to_be_paid()\\" class=\\"col-sm-auto mt8\\">\\n                            <a role=\\"button\\" data-bs-toggle=\\"modal\\" data-bs-target=\\"#modalaccept\\" href=\\"#\\" t-att-class=\\"'%s' % ('btn btn-light' if sale_order.transaction_ids else 'btn btn-primary')\\">\\n                                <i class=\\"fa fa-check\\"/> <t t-if=\\"not sale_order.signature\\">Accept &amp; Pay</t><t t-else=\\"\\">Pay Now</t>\\n                            </a>\\n                        </div>\\n                    </div>\\n\\n                    <!-- chatter -->\\n                    <hr/>\\n                    <div id=\\"sale_order_communication\\">\\n                        <h3>Communication history</h3>\\n                        <t t-call=\\"portal.message_thread\\"/>\\n                    </div>\\n                </div><!-- // #quote_content -->\\n            </div>\\n        </xpath>\\n    <xpath expr=\\".\\" position=\\"attributes\\"><attribute name=\\"t-name\\">sale.sale_order_portal_template</attribute></xpath></data>", "es_AR": "<data name=\\"Sales Order\\" inherit_id=\\"portal.portal_sidebar\\" primary=\\"True\\">\\n        <xpath expr=\\"//div[hasclass('o_portal_sidebar')]\\" position=\\"inside\\">\\n            <t t-set=\\"o_portal_fullwidth_alert\\" groups=\\"sales_team.group_sale_salesman\\">\\n                <!-- Uses backend_url provided in rendering values -->\\n                <t t-call=\\"portal.portal_back_in_edit_mode\\"/>\\n            </t>\\n\\n            <div class=\\"row o_portal_sale_sidebar\\">\\n                <!-- Sidebar -->\\n                <t t-call=\\"portal.portal_record_sidebar\\" id=\\"sale_order_portal_sidebar\\">\\n                    <t t-set=\\"classes\\" t-value=\\"'d-print-none col-lg-3 col-xl-4'\\"/>\\n\\n                    <t t-set=\\"title\\">\\n                        <h2 t-field=\\"sale_order.amount_total\\" data-id=\\"total_amount\\"/>\\n                    </t>\\n                    <t t-set=\\"entries\\">\\n                        <div class=\\"d-flex flex-column gap-4\\">\\n                            <div class=\\"d-flex flex-column gap-2\\" id=\\"sale_order_sidebar_button\\">\\n                                <a t-if=\\"sale_order._has_to_be_signed()\\" role=\\"button\\" class=\\"btn btn-primary d-block\\" data-bs-toggle=\\"modal\\" data-bs-target=\\"#modalaccept\\" href=\\"#\\">\\n                                    <i class=\\"fa fa-check\\"/><t t-if=\\"sale_order._has_to_be_paid()\\"> Firmar y pagar</t><t t-else=\\"\\"> Aceptar y firmar</t>\\n                                </a>\\n                                <a t-elif=\\"sale_order._has_to_be_paid()\\" role=\\"button\\" id=\\"o_sale_portal_paynow\\" data-bs-toggle=\\"modal\\" data-bs-target=\\"#modalaccept\\" href=\\"#\\" t-att-class=\\"'d-block %s' % ('btn btn-light' if sale_order.transaction_ids else 'btn btn-primary')\\">\\n                                    <i class=\\"fa fa-check\\"/> <t t-if=\\"not sale_order.signature\\">Aceptar y pagar</t><t t-else=\\"\\">Pagar ahora</t>\\n                                </a>\\n                                <div class=\\"o_download_pdf d-flex gap-1 flex-lg-column flex-xl-row\\">\\n                                    <div class=\\"flex-grow-1\\">\\n                                        <a class=\\"btn btn-secondary o_print_btn o_portal_invoice_print d-block\\" t-att-href=\\"sale_order.get_portal_url(report_type='pdf')\\" id=\\"print_invoice_report\\" title=\\"Ver detalles\\" target=\\"_blank\\"><i class=\\"fa fa-print\\"/> Ver detalles</a>\\n                                    </div>\\n                                </div>\\n                            </div>\\n\\n                            <div class=\\"navspy flex-grow-1 ps-0\\" t-ignore=\\"true\\" role=\\"complementary\\">\\n                                <ul class=\\"nav flex-column bs-sidenav\\"/>\\n                            </div>\\n\\n                            <t t-if=\\"not sale_order.is_expired and sale_order.state in ['draft', 'sent']\\">\\n                                <div t-if=\\"sale_order.amount_undiscounted - sale_order.amount_untaxed &gt; 0.01\\" class=\\"list-group-item flex-grow-1\\">\\n                                    <small><b class=\\"text-muted\\">Su ventaja </b></small>\\n                                    <small>\\n                                        <b t-field=\\"sale_order.amount_undiscounted\\" t-options=\\"{&quot;widget&quot;: &quot;monetary&quot;, &quot;display_currency&quot;: sale_order.currency_id}\\" style=\\"text-decoration: line-through\\" class=\\"d-block mt-1\\" data-id=\\"amount_undiscounted\\"/>\\n                                    </small>\\n                                    <t t-if=\\"sale_order.amount_untaxed == sale_order.amount_total\\">\\n                                        <h4 t-field=\\"sale_order.amount_total\\" class=\\"text-success\\" data-id=\\"total_amount\\"/>\\n                                    </t>\\n                                    <t t-else=\\"\\">\\n                                        <h4 t-field=\\"sale_order.amount_untaxed\\" class=\\"text-success mb-0\\" data-id=\\"total_untaxed\\"/>\\n                                        <small>(<span t-field=\\"sale_order.amount_total\\" data-id=\\"total_amount\\"/> impuestos incluidos)</small>\\n                                    </t>\\n                                </div>\\n                            </t>\\n\\n                            <div t-if=\\"sale_order.user_id\\">\\n                                <h6><small class=\\"text-muted\\">Su contacto</small></h6>\\n                                <div class=\\"o_portal_contact_details d-flex flex-column gap-2\\">\\n                                    <div class=\\"d-flex justify-content-start align-items-center gap-2\\">\\n                                        <img class=\\"o_avatar o_portal_contact_img rounded\\" t-att-src=\\"image_data_uri(sale_order.user_id.avatar_128)\\" alt=\\"Contacto\\"/>\\n                                        <div>\\n                                            <h6 class=\\"mb-0\\" t-out=\\"sale_order.user_id.name\\"/>\\n                                            <a href=\\"#discussion\\" class=\\"d-flex align-items-center gap-2 small fw-bold\\">\\n                                            Enviar mensaje\\n                                            </a>\\n                                        </div>\\n                                    </div>\\n                                </div>\\n                            </div>\\n                        </div>\\n                    </t>\\n                </t>\\n\\n                <!-- Page content -->\\n                <div id=\\"quote_content\\" class=\\"col-12 col-lg-9 col-xl-8 mt-5 mt-lg-0\\">\\n\\n                    <!-- modal relative to the actions sign and pay -->\\n                    <div role=\\"dialog\\" class=\\"modal fade\\" id=\\"modalaccept\\">\\n                        <div class=\\"modal-dialog\\" t-if=\\"sale_order._has_to_be_signed()\\">\\n                            <form id=\\"accept\\" method=\\"POST\\" t-att-data-order-id=\\"sale_order.id\\" t-att-data-token=\\"sale_order.access_token\\" class=\\"js_accept_json modal-content js_website_submit_form\\">\\n                                <input type=\\"hidden\\" name=\\"csrf_token\\" t-att-value=\\"request.csrf_token()\\"/>\\n                                <header class=\\"modal-header\\">\\n                                    <h4 class=\\"modal-title\\">Validar orden</h4>\\n                                    <button type=\\"button\\" class=\\"btn-close\\" data-bs-dismiss=\\"modal\\" aria-label=\\"Cerrar\\"/>\\n                                </header>\\n                                <main class=\\"modal-body\\" id=\\"sign-dialog\\">\\n                                    <p>\\n                                        <span>Al firmar esta propuesta, acepto los siguientes términos:</span>\\n                                        <ul>\\n                                            <li>\\n                                                <span>Aceptado en nombre de:</span> <b t-field=\\"sale_order.partner_id.commercial_partner_id\\"/>\\n                                            </li>\\n                                            <li>\\n                                                <span>Por un importe de:</span> <b data-id=\\"total_amount\\" t-field=\\"sale_order.amount_total\\"/>\\n                                            </li>\\n                                            <li t-if=\\"sale_order.payment_term_id\\">\\n                                                <span>Con términos de pago:</span> <b t-field=\\"sale_order.payment_term_id.note\\"/>\\n                                            </li>\\n                                        </ul>\\n                                    </p>\\n                                    <t t-call=\\"portal.signature_form\\">\\n                                        <t t-set=\\"call_url\\" t-value=\\"sale_order.get_portal_url(suffix='/accept')\\"/>\\n                                        <t t-set=\\"default_name\\" t-value=\\"sale_order.partner_id.name or sale_order.partner_id.commercial_partner_id.name\\"/>\\n                                    </t>\\n                                </main>\\n                            </form>\\n                        </div>\\n\\n                        <div class=\\"modal-dialog\\" t-if=\\"not sale_order._has_to_be_signed() and sale_order._has_to_be_paid()\\">\\n                            <div class=\\"modal-content\\">\\n                                <header class=\\"modal-header\\">\\n                                    <h4 class=\\"modal-title\\">Validar orden</h4>\\n                                    <button type=\\"button\\" class=\\"btn-close\\" data-bs-dismiss=\\"modal\\" aria-label=\\"Cerrar\\"/>\\n                                </header>\\n                                <main class=\\"modal-body\\" id=\\"sign-dialog\\">\\n                                    <t t-set=\\"prepayment_amount\\" t-value=\\"sale_order._get_prepayment_required_amount()\\"/>\\n                                    <t t-set=\\"prepayment_available\\" t-value=\\"sale_order.prepayment_percent and sale_order.prepayment_percent != 1.0\\"/>\\n                                    <!-- Display choices only if a pre payment can confirm the order. -->\\n                                    <div t-if=\\"prepayment_available\\" id=\\"o_sale_portal_prepayment_buttons\\" class=\\"d-flex justify-content-center d-grid gap-2 btn-group\\">\\n                                        <button name=\\"o_sale_portal_amount_prepayment_button\\" class=\\"btn btn-primary rounded\\">\\n                                            Anticipo <br/>\\n                                            <span t-esc=\\"prepayment_amount\\" class=\\"fw-bold\\" t-options=\\"{'widget': 'monetary', 'display_currency': sale_order.currency_id}\\"/>\\n                                        </button>\\n                                        <button name=\\"o_sale_portal_amount_total_button\\" class=\\"btn btn-primary rounded\\">\\n                                            Importe completo <br/>\\n                                            <span t-field=\\"sale_order.amount_total\\"/>\\n                                        </button>\\n                                    </div>\\n                                    <p>\\n                                        <!-- The widget associated with this modal will hide and show divs in function of the amount selected. -->\\n                                        <div id=\\"o_sale_portal_use_amount_total\\">\\n                                            Al pagar esta propuesta, acepto los siguientes términos:\\n                                        </div>\\n                                        <div t-if=\\"prepayment_available\\" id=\\"o_sale_portal_use_amount_prepayment\\">\\n                                            Al pagar este <u>anticipo</u> de\\n                                            <span t-esc=\\"prepayment_amount\\" class=\\"fw-bold\\" t-options=\\"{'widget': 'monetary', 'display_currency': sale_order.currency_id}\\"/>\\n                                            (<b t-esc=\\"sale_order.prepayment_percent * 100\\"/> %)\\n                                            para esta propuesta, acepto los siguientes términos:\\n                                        </div>\\n                                        <ul>\\n                                            <li>\\n                                                <span>Aceptado en nombre de:</span> <b t-field=\\"sale_order.partner_id.commercial_partner_id\\"/>\\n                                            </li>\\n                                            <li>\\n                                                <span>Por un importe de:</span> <b data-id=\\"total_amount\\" t-field=\\"sale_order.amount_total\\"/>\\n                                            </li>\\n                                            <li t-if=\\"sale_order.payment_term_id\\">\\n                                                <span>Con términos de pago:</span> <b t-field=\\"sale_order.payment_term_id.note\\"/>\\n                                            </li>\\n                                        </ul>\\n                                    </p>\\n                                    <div t-if=\\"company_mismatch\\">\\n                                        <t t-call=\\"payment.company_mismatch_warning\\"/>\\n                                    </div>\\n                                    <div t-elif=\\"not sale_order._has_to_be_paid()\\" class=\\"alert alert-danger\\">\\n                                        La orden no está en un estado que requiera el pago del cliente.\\n                                    </div>\\n                                    <div t-elif=\\"not payment_methods_sudo and not tokens_sudo\\" class=\\"alert alert-warning\\">\\n                                        <strong>No se ha encontrado ninguna opción de pago adecuada.</strong><br/>\\n                                Si cree que se trata de un error, contacte al administrador del sitio web.\\n                                    </div>\\n                                    <div t-else=\\"\\" id=\\"payment_method\\" class=\\"text-start\\">\\n                                        <h3 class=\\"mb-3\\">Pagar con</h3>\\n                                        <t t-call=\\"payment.form\\">\\n                                            <!-- Inject the order ID to allow Stripe to check if tokenization is required. -->\\n                                            <t t-set=\\"sale_order_id\\" t-value=\\"sale_order.id\\"/>\\n                                        </t>\\n                                    </div>\\n                                </main>\\n                            </div>\\n                        </div>\\n                    </div>\\n\\n                    <!-- modal relative to the action reject -->\\n                    <div role=\\"dialog\\" class=\\"modal fade\\" id=\\"modaldecline\\">\\n                        <div class=\\"modal-dialog\\">\\n                            <form id=\\"decline\\" method=\\"POST\\" t-attf-action=\\"/my/orders/#{sale_order.id}/decline?access_token=#{sale_order.access_token}\\" class=\\"modal-content\\">\\n                                <input type=\\"hidden\\" name=\\"csrf_token\\" t-att-value=\\"request.csrf_token()\\"/>\\n                                <header class=\\"modal-header\\">\\n                                    <h4 class=\\"modal-title\\">Rechazar esta cotización</h4>\\n                                    <button type=\\"button\\" class=\\"btn-close\\" data-bs-dismiss=\\"modal\\" aria-label=\\"Cerrar\\"/>\\n                                </header>\\n                                <main class=\\"modal-body\\">\\n                                    <p>\\n                                        Cuéntenos por qué rechaza esta cotización. Nos ayudará a mejorar nuestro servicio.\\n                                    </p>\\n                                    <textarea rows=\\"4\\" name=\\"decline_message\\" required=\\"\\" placeholder=\\"Sus comentarios...\\" class=\\"form-control\\"/>\\n                                </main>\\n                                <footer class=\\"modal-footer\\">\\n                                    <button type=\\"submit\\" t-att-id=\\"sale_order.id\\" class=\\"btn btn-danger\\">\\n                                        <i class=\\"fa fa-times\\"/> Rechazar\\n                                    </button>\\n                                    <button type=\\"button\\" class=\\"btn btn-primary\\" data-bs-dismiss=\\"modal\\">\\n                                        Cancelar\\n                                    </button>\\n                                </footer>\\n                            </form>\\n                        </div>\\n                    </div>\\n\\n                    <!-- status messages -->\\n                    <div t-if=\\"message == 'sign_ok'\\" class=\\"alert alert-success alert-dismissible d-print-none\\" role=\\"status\\">\\n                        <button type=\\"button\\" class=\\"btn-close\\" data-bs-dismiss=\\"alert\\" aria-label=\\"Cerrar\\"/>\\n                        <strong>¡Gracias!</strong><br/>\\n                        <t t-if=\\"message == 'sign_ok' and sale_order.state == 'sale'\\">\\n                            Se ha confirmado su orden.\\n                        </t>\\n                        <t t-elif=\\"message == 'sign_ok' and sale_order._has_to_be_paid()\\">\\n                            Se firmó su orden, pero todavía se necesita procesar el pago para confirmarla.\\n                        </t>\\n                        <t t-else=\\"\\">Se firmó su orden.</t>\\n                    </div>\\n\\n                    <div t-if=\\"message == 'cant_reject'\\" class=\\"alert alert-danger alert-dismissible d-print-none\\" role=\\"alert\\">\\n                        <button type=\\"button\\" class=\\"btn-close\\" data-bs-dismiss=\\"alert\\" aria-label=\\"Cerrar\\"/>\\n                        No se puede rechazar su orden.\\n                    </div>\\n\\n                    <t t-if=\\"sale_order.get_portal_last_transaction()\\">\\n                        <t t-call=\\"payment.transaction_status\\">\\n                            <t t-set=\\"tx\\" t-value=\\"sale_order.get_portal_last_transaction()\\"/>\\n                        </t>\\n                    </t>\\n\\n                    <div t-if=\\"sale_order.state == 'cancel'\\" class=\\"alert alert-danger alert-dismissible d-print-none\\" role=\\"alert\\">\\n                        <button type=\\"button\\" class=\\"btn-close\\" data-bs-dismiss=\\"alert\\" aria-label=\\"cerrar\\"/>\\n                        <strong>Se canceló esta cotización.</strong> <a role=\\"button\\" href=\\"#discussion\\"><i class=\\"fa fa-comment\\"/> Contáctenos para recibir una nueva cotización.</a>\\n                    </div>\\n\\n                    <div t-if=\\"sale_order.is_expired\\" class=\\"alert alert-warning alert-dismissible d-print-none\\" role=\\"alert\\">\\n                        <button type=\\"button\\" class=\\"btn-close\\" data-bs-dismiss=\\"alert\\" aria-label=\\"cerrar\\"/>\\n                        <strong>¡Esta oferta ya venció!</strong> <a role=\\"button\\" href=\\"#discussion\\"><i class=\\"fa fa-comment\\"/> Contáctenos para recibir una nueva cotización.</a>\\n                    </div>\\n\\n                    <!-- main content -->\\n                    <div t-attf-class=\\"#{'pb-5' if report_type == 'html' else ''}\\" id=\\"portal_sale_content\\">\\n                        <div t-call=\\"#{sale_order._get_name_portal_content_view()}\\"/>\\n                    </div>\\n\\n                    <!-- bottom actions -->\\n                    <div t-if=\\"sale_order._has_to_be_signed() or sale_order._has_to_be_paid()\\" class=\\"d-flex justify-content-center gap-1 d-print-none\\">\\n\\n                        <t t-if=\\"sale_order._has_to_be_signed()\\">\\n                            <div class=\\"col-sm-auto mt8\\">\\n                                <a role=\\"button\\" class=\\"btn btn-primary\\" data-bs-toggle=\\"modal\\" data-bs-target=\\"#modalaccept\\" href=\\"#\\"><i class=\\"fa fa-check\\"/><t t-if=\\"sale_order._has_to_be_paid()\\"> Firmar y pagar</t><t t-else=\\"\\"> Aceptar y firmar</t></a>\\n                            </div>\\n                            <div class=\\"col-sm-auto mt8\\">\\n                                <a role=\\"button\\" class=\\"btn btn-secondary\\" href=\\"#discussion\\"><i class=\\"fa fa-comment\\"/> Comentarios</a>\\n                            </div>\\n                            <div class=\\"col-sm-auto mt8\\">\\n                                <a role=\\"button\\" class=\\"btn btn-danger\\" data-bs-toggle=\\"modal\\" data-bs-target=\\"#modaldecline\\" href=\\"#\\"> <i class=\\"fa fa-times\\"/> Rechazar</a>\\n                            </div>\\n                        </t>\\n                        <div t-elif=\\"sale_order._has_to_be_paid()\\" class=\\"col-sm-auto mt8\\">\\n                            <a role=\\"button\\" data-bs-toggle=\\"modal\\" data-bs-target=\\"#modalaccept\\" href=\\"#\\" t-att-class=\\"'%s' % ('btn btn-light' if sale_order.transaction_ids else 'btn btn-primary')\\">\\n                                <i class=\\"fa fa-check\\"/> <t t-if=\\"not sale_order.signature\\">Aceptar y pagar</t><t t-else=\\"\\">Pagar ahora</t>\\n                            </a>\\n                        </div>\\n                    </div>\\n\\n                    <!-- chatter -->\\n                    <hr/>\\n                    <div id=\\"sale_order_communication\\">\\n                        <h3>Historial de comunicación</h3>\\n                        <t t-call=\\"portal.message_thread\\"/>\\n                    </div>\\n                </div><!-- // #quote_content -->\\n            </div>\\n        </xpath>\\n    <xpath expr=\\".\\" position=\\"attributes\\"><attribute name=\\"t-name\\">sale.sale_order_portal_template</attribute></xpath></data>"}	<?xml version="1.0"?>\n<data name="Sales Order" inherit_id="portal.portal_sidebar" primary="True">\n        <xpath expr="//div[hasclass('o_portal_sidebar')]" position="inside">\n            <t t-set="o_portal_fullwidth_alert" groups="sales_team.group_sale_salesman">\n                <!-- Uses backend_url provided in rendering values -->\n                <t t-call="portal.portal_back_in_edit_mode"/>\n            </t>\n\n            <div class="row o_portal_sale_sidebar">\n                <!-- Sidebar -->\n                <t t-call="portal.portal_record_sidebar" id="sale_order_portal_sidebar">\n                    <t t-set="classes" t-value="'d-print-none col-lg-3 col-xl-4'"/>\n\n                    <t t-set="title">\n                        <h2 t-field="sale_order.amount_total" data-id="total_amount"/>\n                    </t>\n                    <t t-set="entries">\n                        <div class="d-flex flex-column gap-4">\n                            <div class="d-flex flex-column gap-2" id="sale_order_sidebar_button">\n                                <a t-if="sale_order._has_to_be_signed()" role="button" class="btn btn-primary d-block" data-bs-toggle="modal" data-bs-target="#modalaccept" href="#">\n                                    <i class="fa fa-check"/><t t-if="sale_order._has_to_be_paid()"> Sign &amp; Pay</t><t t-else=""> Accept &amp; Sign</t>\n                                </a>\n                                <a t-elif="sale_order._has_to_be_paid()" role="button" id="o_sale_portal_paynow" data-bs-toggle="modal" data-bs-target="#modalaccept" href="#" t-att-class="'d-block %s' % ('btn btn-light' if sale_order.transaction_ids else 'btn btn-primary')">\n                                    <i class="fa fa-check"/> <t t-if="not sale_order.signature">Accept &amp; Pay</t><t t-else="">Pay Now</t>\n                                </a>\n                                <div class="o_download_pdf d-flex gap-1 flex-lg-column flex-xl-row">\n                                    <div class="flex-grow-1">\n                                        <a class="btn btn-secondary o_print_btn o_portal_invoice_print d-block" t-att-href="sale_order.get_portal_url(report_type='pdf')" id="print_invoice_report" title="View Details" target="_blank"><i class="fa fa-print"/> View Details</a>\n                                    </div>\n                                </div>\n                            </div>\n\n                            <div class="navspy flex-grow-1 ps-0" t-ignore="true" role="complementary">\n                                <ul class="nav flex-column bs-sidenav"/>\n                            </div>\n\n                            <t t-if="not sale_order.is_expired and sale_order.state in ['draft', 'sent']">\n                                <div t-if="sale_order.amount_undiscounted - sale_order.amount_untaxed &gt; 0.01" class="list-group-item flex-grow-1">\n                                    <small><b class="text-muted">Your advantage</b></small>\n                                    <small>\n                                        <b t-field="sale_order.amount_undiscounted" t-options="{&quot;widget&quot;: &quot;monetary&quot;, &quot;display_currency&quot;: sale_order.currency_id}" style="text-decoration: line-through" class="d-block mt-1" data-id="amount_undiscounted"/>\n                                    </small>\n                                    <t t-if="sale_order.amount_untaxed == sale_order.amount_total">\n                                        <h4 t-field="sale_order.amount_total" class="text-success" data-id="total_amount"/>\n                                    </t>\n                                    <t t-else="">\n                                        <h4 t-field="sale_order.amount_untaxed" class="text-success mb-0" data-id="total_untaxed"/>\n                                        <small>(<span t-field="sale_order.amount_total" data-id="total_amount"/> Incl. tax)</small>\n                                    </t>\n                                </div>\n                            </t>\n\n                            <div t-if="sale_order.user_id">\n                                <h6><small class="text-muted">Your contact</small></h6>\n                                <div class="o_portal_contact_details d-flex flex-column gap-2">\n                                    <div class="d-flex justify-content-start align-items-center gap-2">\n                                        <img class="o_avatar o_portal_contact_img rounded" t-att-src="image_data_uri(sale_order.user_id.avatar_128)" alt="Contact"/>\n                                        <div>\n                                            <h6 class="mb-0" t-out="sale_order.user_id.name"/>\n                                            <a href="#discussion" class="d-flex align-items-center gap-2 small fw-bold">\n                                            Send message\n                                            </a>\n                                        </div>\n                                    </div>\n                                </div>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </t>\n                </t>\n\n                <!-- Page content -->\n                <div id="quote_content" class="col-12 col-lg-9 col-xl-8 mt-5 mt-lg-0">\n\n                    <!-- modal relative to the actions sign and pay -->\n                    <div role="dialog" class="modal fade" id="modalaccept">\n                        <div class="modal-dialog" t-if="sale_order._has_to_be_signed()">\n                            <form id="accept" method="POST" t-att-data-order-id="sale_order.id" t-att-data-token="sale_order.access_token" class="js_accept_json modal-content js_website_submit_form">\n                                <input type="hidden" name="csrf_token" t-att-value="request.csrf_token()"/>\n                                <header class="modal-header">\n                                    <h4 class="modal-title">Validate Order</h4>\n                                    <button type="button" class="btn-close" data-bs-dismiss="modal" aria-label="Close"/>\n                                </header>\n                                <main class="modal-body" id="sign-dialog">\n                                    <p>\n                                        <span>By signing this proposal, I agree to the following terms:</span>\n                                        <ul>\n                                            <li>\n                                                <span>Accepted on the behalf of:</span> <b t-field="sale_order.partner_id.commercial_partner_id"/>\n                                            </li>\n                                            <li>\n                                                <span>For an amount of:</span> <b data-id="total_amount" t-field="sale_order.amount_total"/>\n                                            </li>\n                                            <li t-if="sale_order.payment_term_id">\n                                                <span>With payment terms:</span> <b t-field="sale_order.payment_term_id.note"/>\n                                            </li>\n                                        </ul>\n                                    </p>\n                                    <t t-call="portal.signature_form">\n                                        <t t-set="call_url" t-value="sale_order.get_portal_url(suffix='/accept')"/>\n                                        <t t-set="default_name" t-value="sale_order.partner_id.name or sale_order.partner_id.commercial_partner_id.name"/>\n                                    </t>\n                                </main>\n                            </form>\n                        </div>\n\n                        <div class="modal-dialog" t-if="not sale_order._has_to_be_signed() and sale_order._has_to_be_paid()">\n                            <div class="modal-content">\n                                <header class="modal-header">\n                                    <h4 class="modal-title">Validate Order</h4>\n                                    <button type="button" class="btn-close" data-bs-dismiss="modal" aria-label="Close"/>\n                                </header>\n                                <main class="modal-body" id="sign-dialog">\n                                    <t t-set="prepayment_amount" t-value="sale_order._get_prepayment_required_amount()"/>\n                                    <t t-set="prepayment_available" t-value="sale_order.prepayment_percent and sale_order.prepayment_percent != 1.0"/>\n                                    <!-- Display choices only if a pre payment can confirm the order. -->\n                                    <div t-if="prepayment_available" id="o_sale_portal_prepayment_buttons" class="d-flex justify-content-center d-grid gap-2 btn-group">\n                                        <button name="o_sale_portal_amount_prepayment_button" class="btn btn-primary rounded">\n                                            Down payment <br/>\n                                            <span t-esc="prepayment_amount" class="fw-bold" t-options="{'widget': 'monetary', 'display_currency': sale_order.currency_id}"/>\n                                        </button>\n                                        <button name="o_sale_portal_amount_total_button" class="btn btn-primary rounded">\n                                            Full amount <br/>\n                                            <span t-field="sale_order.amount_total"/>\n                                        </button>\n                                    </div>\n                                    <p>\n                                        <!-- The widget associated with this modal will hide and show divs in function of the amount selected. -->\n                                        <div id="o_sale_portal_use_amount_total">\n                                            By paying this proposal, I agree to the following terms:\n                                        </div>\n                                        <div t-if="prepayment_available" id="o_sale_portal_use_amount_prepayment">\n                                            By paying this <u>down payment</u> of\n                                            <span t-esc="prepayment_amount" class="fw-bold" t-options="{'widget': 'monetary', 'display_currency': sale_order.currency_id}"/>\n                                            (<b t-esc="sale_order.prepayment_percent * 100"/> %)\n                                            for this proposal, I agree to the following terms:\n                                        </div>\n                                        <ul>\n                                            <li>\n                                                <span>Accepted on the behalf of:</span> <b t-field="sale_order.partner_id.commercial_partner_id"/>\n                                            </li>\n                                            <li>\n                                                <span>For an amount of:</span> <b data-id="total_amount" t-field="sale_order.amount_total"/>\n                                            </li>\n                                            <li t-if="sale_order.payment_term_id">\n                                                <span>With payment terms:</span> <b t-field="sale_order.payment_term_id.note"/>\n                                            </li>\n                                        </ul>\n                                    </p>\n                                    <div t-if="company_mismatch">\n                                        <t t-call="payment.company_mismatch_warning"/>\n                                    </div>\n                                    <div t-elif="not sale_order._has_to_be_paid()" class="alert alert-danger">\n                                        The order is not in a state requiring customer payment.\n                                    </div>\n                                    <div t-elif="not payment_methods_sudo and not tokens_sudo" class="alert alert-warning">\n                                        <strong>No suitable payment option could be found.</strong><br/>\n                                        If you believe that it is an error, please contact the website administrator.\n                                    </div>\n                                    <div t-else="" id="payment_method" class="text-start">\n                                        <h3 class="mb-3">Pay with</h3>\n                                        <t t-call="payment.form">\n                                            <!-- Inject the order ID to allow Stripe to check if tokenization is required. -->\n                                            <t t-set="sale_order_id" t-value="sale_order.id"/>\n                                        </t>\n                                    </div>\n                                </main>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <!-- modal relative to the action reject -->\n                    <div role="dialog" class="modal fade" id="modaldecline">\n                        <div class="modal-dialog">\n                            <form id="decline" method="POST" t-attf-action="/my/orders/#{sale_order.id}/decline?access_token=#{sale_order.access_token}" class="modal-content">\n                                <input type="hidden" name="csrf_token" t-att-value="request.csrf_token()"/>\n                                <header class="modal-header">\n                                    <h4 class="modal-title">Reject This Quotation</h4>\n                                    <button type="button" class="btn-close" data-bs-dismiss="modal" aria-label="Close"/>\n                                </header>\n                                <main class="modal-body">\n                                    <p>\n                                        Tell us why you are refusing this quotation, this will help us improve our services.\n                                    </p>\n                                    <textarea rows="4" name="decline_message" required="" placeholder="Your feedback..." class="form-control"/>\n                                </main>\n                                <footer class="modal-footer">\n                                    <button type="submit" t-att-id="sale_order.id" class="btn btn-danger">\n                                        <i class="fa fa-times"/> Reject\n                                    </button>\n                                    <button type="button" class="btn btn-primary" data-bs-dismiss="modal">\n                                        Cancel\n                                    </button>\n                                </footer>\n                            </form>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <!-- status messages -->\n                    <div t-if="message == 'sign_ok'" class="alert alert-success alert-dismissible d-print-none" role="status">\n                        <button type="button" class="btn-close" data-bs-dismiss="alert" aria-label="Close"/>\n                        <strong>Thank You!</strong><br/>\n                        <t t-if="message == 'sign_ok' and sale_order.state == 'sale'">\n                            Your order has been confirmed.\n                        </t>\n                        <t t-elif="message == 'sign_ok' and sale_order._has_to_be_paid()">\n                            Your order has been signed but still needs to be paid to be confirmed.\n                        </t>\n                        <t t-else="">Your order has been signed.</t>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <div t-if="message == 'cant_reject'" class="alert alert-danger alert-dismissible d-print-none" role="alert">\n                        <button type="button" class="btn-close" data-bs-dismiss="alert" aria-label="Close"/>\n                        Your order is not in a state to be rejected.\n                    </div>\n\n                    <t t-if="sale_order.get_portal_last_transaction()">\n                        <t t-call="payment.transaction_status">\n                            <t t-set="tx" t-value="sale_order.get_portal_last_transaction()"/>\n                        </t>\n                    </t>\n\n                    <div t-if="sale_order.state == 'cancel'" class="alert alert-danger alert-dismissible d-print-none" role="alert">\n                        <button type="button" class="btn-close" data-bs-dismiss="alert" aria-label="close"/>\n                        <strong>This quotation has been canceled.</strong> <a role="button" href="#discussion"><i class="fa fa-comment"/> Contact us to get a new quotation.</a>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <div t-if="sale_order.is_expired" class="alert alert-warning alert-dismissible d-print-none" role="alert">\n                        <button type="button" class="btn-close" data-bs-dismiss="alert" aria-label="close"/>\n                        <strong>This offer expired!</strong> <a role="button" href="#discussion"><i class="fa fa-comment"/> Contact us to get a new quotation.</a>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <!-- main content -->\n                    <div t-attf-class="#{'pb-5' if report_type == 'html' else ''}" id="portal_sale_content">\n                        <div t-call="#{sale_order._get_name_portal_content_view()}"/>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <!-- bottom actions -->\n                    <div t-if="sale_order._has_to_be_signed() or sale_order._has_to_be_paid()" class="d-flex justify-content-center gap-1 d-print-none">\n\n                        <t t-if="sale_order._has_to_be_signed()">\n                            <div class="col-sm-auto mt8">\n                                <a role="button" class="btn btn-primary" data-bs-toggle="modal" data-bs-target="#modalaccept" href="#"><i class="fa fa-check"/><t t-if="sale_order._has_to_be_paid()"> Sign &amp; Pay</t><t t-else=""> Accept &amp; Sign</t></a>\n                            </div>\n                            <div class="col-sm-auto mt8">\n                                <a role="button" class="btn btn-secondary" href="#discussion"><i class="fa fa-comment"/> Feedback</a>\n                            </div>\n                            <div class="col-sm-auto mt8">\n                                <a role="button" class="btn btn-danger" data-bs-toggle="modal" data-bs-target="#modaldecline" href="#"> <i class="fa fa-times"/> Reject</a>\n                            </div>\n                        </t>\n                        <div t-elif="sale_order._has_to_be_paid()" class="col-sm-auto mt8">\n                            <a role="button" data-bs-toggle="modal" data-bs-target="#modalaccept" href="#" t-att-class="'%s' % ('btn btn-light' if sale_order.transaction_ids else 'btn btn-primary')">\n                                <i class="fa fa-check"/> <t t-if="not sale_order.signature">Accept &amp; Pay</t><t t-else="">Pay Now</t>\n                            </a>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <!-- chatter -->\n                    <hr/>\n                    <div id="sale_order_communication">\n                        <h3>Communication history</h3>\n                        <t t-call="portal.message_thread"/>\n                    </div>\n                </div><!-- // #quote_content -->\n            </div>\n        </xpath>\n    <xpath expr="." position="attributes"><attribute name="t-name">sale.sale_order_portal_template</attribute></xpath></data>\n\n    	f	t	2026-10-30 14:24:31.464076	2026-10-30 14:24:31.464076	f	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N
