1705	16	1701	1	1	new_page_template_services_s_text_block_2nd	\N	website.new_page_template_services_s_text_block_2nd	qweb	website/views/new_page_template_templates.xml	primary	{"en_US": "<data inherit_id=\\"website.new_page_template_s_text_block_2nd\\" primary=\\"True\\">\\n    <xpath expr=\\"//p\\" position=\\"replace\\">\\n        <p>Welcome to our comprehensive range of Tailored Fitness Coaching Services, with personalized workouts, customized nutrition plans, and unwavering support, we're committed to helping you achieve lasting results that align with your aspirations.</p>\\n        <p>It's time to elevate your fitness journey with coaching that's as unique as you are. Choose your path, embrace the guidance, and transform your life.</p>\\n    </xpath>\\n<xpath expr=\\".\\" position=\\"attributes\\"><attribute name=\\"t-name\\">website.new_page_template_services_s_text_block_2nd</attribute></xpath></data>", "es_AR": "<data inherit_id=\\"website.new_page_template_s_text_block_2nd\\" primary=\\"True\\">\\n    <xpath expr=\\"//p\\" position=\\"replace\\">\\n        <p>Le damos la bienvenida a nuestro catálogo de servicios de entrenamiento físico personalizado. Ofrecemos rutinas y planes nutricionales personalizados, así como apoyo constante. Nos comprometemos a ayudarle a conseguir resultados duraderos que se ajusten a sus expectativas.</p>\\n        <p>Ha llegado el momento de mejorar su forma física con un entrenamiento tan único como usted. Elija su camino, acepte la ayuda y transforme su vida.</p>\\n    </xpath>\\n<xpath expr=\\".\\" position=\\"attributes\\"><attribute name=\\"t-name\\">website.new_page_template_services_s_text_block_2nd</attribute></xpath></data>"}	<?xml version="1.0"?>\n<data inherit_id="website.new_page_template_s_text_block_2nd" primary="True">\n    <xpath expr="//p" position="replace">\n        <p>Welcome to our comprehensive range of Tailored Fitness Coaching Services, with personalized workouts, customized nutrition plans, and unwavering