1803	16	1802	1	1	new_page_template_landing_s_showcase	\N	website.new_page_template_landing_s_showcase	qweb	website/views/new_page_template_templates.xml	primary	{"en_US": "<data inherit_id=\\"website.new_page_template_s_showcase\\" primary=\\"True\\">\\n    <xpath expr=\\"//h3|//h4\\" position=\\"replace\\">\\n        <h3>Intuitive Touch Controls</h3>\\n    </xpath>\\n    <xpath expr=\\"(//h3)[2]\\" position=\\"replace\\">\\n        <h3>Secure and Comfortable Fit</h3>\\n    </xpath>\\n    <xpath expr=\\"(//h3)[3]\\" position=\\"replace\\">\\n        <h3>On-the-Go Charging</h3>\\n    </xpath>\\n    <xpath expr=\\"(//h3)[4]\\" position=\\"replace\\">\\n        <h3>Sleek and Modern Design</h3>\\n    </xpath>\\n    <xpath expr=\\"//p\\" position=\\"replace\\">\\n        <p>Adjust volume, skip tracks, answer calls, and activate voice assistants with a simple tap, keeping your hands free and your focus on what matters most.</p>\\n    </xpath>\\n    <xpath expr=\\"(//p)[2]\\" position=\\"replace\\">\\n        <p>EchoTunes comes with customizable ear tip sizes that provide a secure and comfortable fit.</p>\\n    </xpath>\\n    <xpath expr=\\"(//p)[3]\\" position=\\"replace\\">\\n        <p>The compact charging case offers convenient on-the-go charging with a battery life that lasts up to 17h, you can enjoy your favorite tunes without interruption.</p>\\n    </xpath>\\n    <xpath expr=\\"(//p)[4]\\" position=\\"replace\\">\\n        <p>The earbuds fit seamlessly into your lifestyle, while the charging case's pocket-friendly size ensures you can carry your audio experience wherever you roam.</p>\\n    </xpath>\\n<xpath expr=\\".\\" position=\\"attributes\\"><attribute name=\\"t-name\\">website.new_page_template_landing_s_showcase</attribute></xpath></data>", "es_AR": "<data inherit_id=\\"website.new_page_template_s_showcase\\" primary=\\"True\\">\\n    <xpath expr=\\"//h3|//h4\\" position=\\"replace\\">\\n        <h3>Controles táctiles intuitivos</h3>\\n    </xpath>\\n    <xpath expr=\\"(//h3)[2]\\" position=\\"replace\\">\\n        <h3>Ajuste cómodo y seguro</h3>\\n    </xpath>\\n    <xpath expr=\\"(//h3)[3]\\" position=\\"replace\\">\\n        <h3>Carga sobre la marcha</h3>\\n    </xpath>\\n    <xpath expr=\\"(//h3)[4]\\" position=\\"replace\\">\\n        <h3>Diseño elegante y moderno</h3>\\n    </xpath>\\n    <xpath expr=\\"//p\\" position=\\"replace\\">\\n        <p>Ajuste el volumen, omita canciones, responda llamadas y active el asistente de voz, ¡todo con solo pulsar un botón! De este modo tendrá las manos libres y podrá concentrarse en lo que más le importa.</p>\\n    </xpath>\\n    <xpath expr=\\"(//p)[2]\\" position=\\"replace\\">\\n        <p>EchoTunes incluye almohadillas personalizables que proporcionan un ajuste seguro y cómodo.</p>\\n    </xpath>\\n    <xpath expr=\\"(//p)[3]\\" position=\\"replace\\">\\n        <p>El estuche de carga compacto ofrece una carga práctica en cualquier lugar con una duración de la batería de hasta 17 horas. Podrá disfrutar de sus canciones favoritas sin interrupciones.</p>\\n    </xpath>\\n    <xpath expr=\\"(//p)[4]\\" position=\\"replace\\">\\n        <p>Los auriculares se adaptan perfectamente a su estilo de vida, mientras que el estuche de carga es de tamaño bolsillo para que los pueda llevar a todos lados.</p>\\n    </xpath>\\n<xpath expr=\\".\\" position=\\"attributes\\"><attribute name=\\"t-name\\">website.new_page_template_landing_s_showcase</attribute></xpath></data>"}	<?xml version="1.0"?>\n<data inherit_id="website.new_page_template_s_showcase" primary="True">\n    <xpath expr="//h3|//h4" position="replace">\n        <h3>Intuitive Touch Controls</h3>\n    </xpath>\n    <xpath expr="(//h3)[2]" position="replace">\n        <h3>Secure and Comfortable Fit</h3>\n    </xpath>\n    <xpath expr="(//h3)[3]" position="replace">\n        <h3>On-the-Go Charging</h3>\n    </xpath>\n    <xpath expr="(//h3)[4]" position="replace">\n        <h3>Sleek and Modern Design</h3>\n    </xpath>\n    <xpat